 Silchar\n48.\nNIT, Warangal\n49.\nNITK Surathkal, Mangalore\n50.\nNMAM Institute of Technology, Nitte, Udupi District, Karnataka State\n51.\nPSG College of Technology, Coimbatore\n52.\nPSG Institute of Advanced Studies, Coimbatore\n53.\nRajalakshmi Engineering College, Chennai\n54.\nRathinam Technical Campus, Pollachi Road, Eachanari, Coimbatore\n55.\nRV College of Engineering, Bangalore\n56.\nSastra Deemed to be University, Tirumalaisamudram\n57.\nSchool of Mechanical Engineering, SASTRA Deemed to University, Tirumalaisamudram, Thanjavur\n58.\nSchool of Physics, University of Hyderabad, Gachibowli, Hyderabad\n59.\nSDM College of Engineering & Technology, Dhawalgiri, Dharwad\n60.\nSreepathy Institute of Management and Technology, Koottanad, Plalakkad Dt. Kerala\n61.\nSRM Institute of Science and Technology, SRM Nagar, Kattankulathur Kancheepuram District\n62.\nSSN College of Engineering, Rajiv Gandhi Salai (OMR), Kalavakkam, Kanchipuram (Dt.)\n63.\nUniversity College of Science, Osmania University, Hyderabad\n64.\nUniversity of Mumbai, Mumbai\n65.\nVardhaman College of Engineering, Kacharam, Shamshabad, Rangareddy Dist.\n66.\nVel Tech Rangarajan Dr. Sagunthala R&D Institute of Science and Technology, Avadi, Chennai\n67.\nVIT University, Vellore\n68.\nZ.H. College of Engineering & Technology, Aligarh Muslim University, Aligarh"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/aeronautics-research-development/rules-grants-introductions", "content": "Submission\nWho May Submit\nThe proposal can be submitted by academia/ research institutes (Principle Investigators) available in the country engaged in the field of aeronautics. Grants are offered to Indian academic institutions of national importance/repute, national science and technology centres, research institutions, non-profit professional societies performing advance research, acclaimed scientists attached to approved research and also private institutions.\nWhere/ Whom to Submit\nThe proposal is required to be submitted through email:\nardb[dot]hqr[at]gov[dot]in\nalongwith two hard copies to the AR&DB Secretariat, Ministry of Defence (R&D), DRDO Headquarters Annexe, Old LASTEC Building, 4th Floor, Room No. 411, Metcalfe House, Civil Lines, Delhi-110054. The proposal would be submitted by Principle Investigators (PIs) in the format as provided as per DERIPR links. The proposal must clearly bring out an appreciation of how the project would lead to better Aeronautical research and development."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/aeronautics-research-development/scholarship-schemes", "content": "DRDO Scholarship scheme exclusively for girls-2021\nThe following students have been selected to receive the DRDO scholarship (exclusively for girls) for the year 2021\nLIST OF POST GRADUTE STUDENTS\nS.No\nName of Student\nInstitute\n1.\nUma Maurya\nDefence Institute of Advanced Technology, Pune\n2.\nMorvadia Aisha Ikbalbhai\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur\n3.\nShambhavi AS\nNitte Meenakshi Institute of Technology, Karnataka\n4.\nSushmasri G\nVisvesvaraya Technological University, Karnataka\nLIST OF UNDER GRADUTE STUDENTS\nS.No\nName of Student\nInstitute\n1.\nRanparia Hitika Vipulbhai\nAmrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham, Tamilnadu\n2.\nSrishti Gupta\nIndian Institute of Space Science & Technology, Thiruvananthapuram\n3.\nNavya Anil\nIndian Institute of Space Science & Technology, Thiruvananthapuram\n4.\nAnanya Elizabeth Thomas\nIndian Institute of Space Science & Technology, Thiruvananthapuram\n5.\nMaddineni Poojitha\nIndian Institute of Space Science & Technology, Thiruvananthapuram\n6.\nTanya Kumari\nIndian Institute of Space Science & Technology, Thiruvananthapuram\n7.\nApoora Kanti\nIndian Institute of Technology, Bombay\n8.\nSana Anesha Shabbeer\nIndian Institute of Technology, Hyderabad\n9.\nAnushree Shukla\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur\n10.\nAysha Siya P\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur\n11.\nGajula Geethanjali\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur\n12.\nSarvasiddi.lakshmi Ruthika Ram\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur\n13.\nHarshita Kaushal\nIndian Institute of Technology, Madras\n14.\nSomya Kumari\nMotilal Nehru National Institute of Technology, Allahabad\n15.\nVidhi Arya\nPunjab Engineering College, Chandigarh\n16.\nMehak Panwar\nPunjab Engineering College, Chandigarh\n17.\nKesia Ajith\nPunjab Engineering College, Chandigarh\n18.\nKanwalpreet Kaur\nPunjab Engineering College, Chandigarh\n19.\nLakshmi Manasa CN\nRashtreya Vidyalaya College of Engineering\nDRDO Scholarship scheme exclusively for girls-2020\nThe following students have been selected to receive the DRDO scholarship (exclusively for Girls) for the year 2020-21.\nLIST OF POST GRADUATE STUDENTS\nS No\nName of Student\nInstitute\n1.\nMane Suvidya Namdeo\nIndian Institute of Technology, Guwahati, Assam\n2.\nKarad Sneha Balaji\nIndian Institute of Technology, Guwahati, Assam\n3.\nBhavsar Mahima Tarunkumar\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur, Uttar Pradesh\n4.\nNisha Singh\nIIT Bombay, Powai, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India\n5.\nSweety Mondal\nBIT Mesra Campus Birla Institute of Technology, Mesra Ranchi, Jharkhand\nLIST OF UNDER GRADUATE STUDENTS\nS No\nName of Student\nInstitute\n1.\nShaik Rooma Sultana\nIndian Institute of Technology, Bombay\n2.\nVibha Karnad\nIndian Institute of Technology, Bombay\n3.\nSnehal Shangari\nIndian Institute of Technology, Bombay\n4.\nMili R Pillai\nIndian Institute of Technology, Bombay\n5.\nGitika Mittal\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur\n6.\nAditi Phogat\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur\n7.\nShrutikirti Singh\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur\n8.\nSwarnima Saxena\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kharagpur\n9.\nGauri Patki\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kharagpur\n10.\nAnwaya Anil\nIndian Institute of Technology, Madras\n11.\nMadhura Narayana Sabhahit\nIndian Institute of Technology, Madras\n12.\nMudapaka Amrutha\nIndian Institute of Technology, Madras\n13.\nDornala Hamsika\nIndian Institute of Technology, Madras\n14.\nT Prema Prescilla\nIndian Institute of Technology, Madras\n15.\nSuchitra Senthil\nIndian Institute of Technology, Madras\n16.\nBismanjyot Kaur Bindra\nPunjab Engineering College\n17.\nIshita Gupta\nPunjab Engineering College\n18.\nVasoya Meghana Arvindbhai\nPunjab Engineering College\n19.\nSamriddhi Mukhopadhyay\nIndian Institute of Engineering Science and Technology, Shibpur\n20.\nDandu Laxmi Kavya\nIndian Institute of Engineering Science and Technology, Shibpur\nDR