{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/armaments-research-board/purpose", "content": "Who May Submit\nIndian academic institutions of national importance/repute, national science and technology centres, research institutions, non-profit professional societies performing advance research, acclaimed scientists attached to approved research institutions, UGC/AICTE/MHRD recognized self financing / private institutions\nPermanent faculty member / researcher as Principal Investigator (PI) of the institutes. PI will be able to take one research project at a time from DRDO funding.\nWhere to Submit\nThe project proposal may be submitted throughout the year. The project proposal to be submitted in Short Proposal Format as per thrust areas of the panel to the Member Secretary (MS ARMREB). MS ARMREB, in turn, will take the recommendation of respective User Lab and Panel and intimate PI to submit the detailed proposal.\nShort Proposal Format (Restricted to Maximum 2 Pages Only)\nProject Title\nInstitute Name\nPI & Co-PI\nTechnical brief on the proposed project\nDeliverables & Outcome of the project\nThrust area and relevance with Armament Labs / Panels (TBRL, HEMRL, ARDE, PXE & CFEES)"},
