{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/centre_for_military_airworthines/contact-us#top", "content": "All Correspondence to be addressed to\nThe Chief Executive (Airworthiness)\nCentre for Military Airworthiness and Certification (CEMILAC)\nDefence Research & Development Organisation (DRDO)\nGovt. of India, Ministry of Defence\nMarathahalli Colony Post, Bengaluru - 560037\nTel: 08025230680/08025121001 | Fax: 080-25230856\nEmail: chief[dot]cemilac[at]gov[dot]in\nDirectorates\nDirector (Aircraft)\nTel: 080 2512 1100\nFax: 080 2523 4368\nDirector (Materials &\nPublic Interface)\nTel: 080 2512 1400\nFax: 080 2523 4765\nDirector (Propulsion)\nTel: 080 2512 1300\nFax: 080 2523 4781\nDirector (Systems)\nTel: 080 2512 1451\nFax: 080 2523 0856\nREGIONAL CENTRES (RCMAs) OF CEMILAC\nRCMA (Air Armament)\nArmament PO, Pashan\nPune- 411 012\nTel: 020 2586 5006\nFax: 020 2586 5605\nRCMA (A/c)\nC/o Aircraft Division\nVimanapura Post\nBengaluru – 560 017\nTel: 080 2522 6375\nFax: 080 2523 3673\nRCMA (APS)\nMarathalli Colony Post\nBengaluru – 560 037\nTel: 080 2512 1501\nFax: 080 2523 0856\nRCMA (Chandigarh)\nC/o 3 BRD Air Force,\nChandigarh – 160 003\nTel: 0172 2637225\nFax: 0172 2637017\nRCMA (Engines)\nC/o HAL Engine Division\nCV Raman Nagar Post\nBengaluru – 560 093\nTel: 080 2524 2341 Fax: 080 2524 0075\nRCMA (F&F)\nC/o HAL Helicopter Division\nRCMA (H/c) Building\nBengaluru – 560 017\nTel: 080 22323936\nFax: 080 25236516\nRCMA (Goa)\nC/o INAS 552\nNFTS, INS Hansa\nDabolim, Goa-403801\nRCMA (GTRE)\nC/o GTRE, DRDO\nCV Raman Nagar Post\nBengaluru – 560 093\nTel: 080 2519 4060\nFax: 080 2524 5572\nRCMA (Helicopter)\nC/o HAL Helicopter Division\nBengaluru – 560 017\nTel: 080 2523 1533\nFax: 080 2523 2139\nRCMA (Hyderabad)\nC/o. HAL Hyderabad Division\nHyderabad – 500 042\nTel: 040 2377 9301\nFax: 040 2377 9350\nRCMA (Kanpur)\nC/o. HAL (TAD)\nChakeri Aerodrome PO.\nKanpur- 208 008\nTel: 0512 2453 693  Fax: 0512 2457 101\nRCMA (Koraput)\nC/o HAL Koraput Division\nPost Box No. 15\nSunabeda – 763 002\nTel: 06853 221677\nFax: 06853220382\nRCMA (Korwa)\nC/o HAL Korwa Division\nSultanpur – 227 412\nTel: 05368 255156|\nFax: 05368 255068\nRCMA (Lucknow)\nC/o HAL Lucknow Division\nLucknow – 226 016\nTel: 0522 2351 206\nFax: 0522 2350 022\nRCMA (Materials)\nKanchanbagh PO,\nHyderabad – 500 058\nTel: 040 2434 0750\nFax: 040 2434 1827\nRCMA (Missiles)\nDRDL Campus\nKanchanbagh PO,\nHyderabad – 500 058\nTel: 040 2980 4057\nFax: 040 2434 1142\nRCMA (Nasik)\nC/o HAL Nasik\nOjhar Township,\nNasik – 422 207\nTel: 02550 275159\nFax: 02550 275912\nRCMA (Software)\nMarathalli Colony Post\nBengaluru – 560 037\nTel: 080 2512 1451\nFax: 080 2523 3673\nDirectory of Directors: CEMILAC\nSI. No.\nName\nDesignation\nLandline\nFax\n1.\nDr AK Bakare, Sc-H\nDirector (Aircraft)\n080 25121100\n080-25234368\n2.\nShri LN Raghvendra, Sc-H\nDirector (Prop)\n080 25121300\n080-25234781\n3.\nDr Shirish S Kale, Sc-G\nDirector (Mat & PI)\n080 25121400\n080-25234765\n4.\nSmt. NA Anuradha, Sc-G\nDirector (Systems)\n080 25121451\n080-25230856\n5.\nShri SK Jha, Sc-G\nGD (MS)\n080 25121049\n080-25230856"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/centre_for_military_airworthines/core-competence#top", "content": "The Centre for Military Airworthiness & Certification (CEMILAC) performs Certification and Airworthiness Activities related to Aircraft, Helicopters, Unmanned Aerial Vehicles(UAV), Air Launched weapons, Engines and the Systems operated by the Air Force, Navy, Coast guard and Army. CEMILAC co-ordinates with Services. CEMILAC does performance evaluation of Bought Out Item (BOI). CEMILAC formulates and implements airworthiness Directives. CEMILAC does technical supervision & review of on-going state of the art projects in the country. The regional offices are called as Regional Centre for Military Airworthiness (RCMAs). Each RCMA has got airworthiness certification task/activity in a different domain."},
