{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/ceptm-advertisement/2038", "content": "Home\nDownloads/Important Links\nGeneral Guidelines\nPublic Disclosure of Marks & Other Details of non-recommended willing Candidates\nAdvertisement\nविज्ञापन\nCEPTAM-10/DRTC\nNew\nCEPTAM-10/A&A\nNew\nCEPTAM/PBM/2023/01\nNew\nWebsite\nwww.drdo.gov.in\nEmail\nhelpdesk[at]ceptam10[dot]com\nHelpdesk Number\n011 - 23882332/33/34, 23819217\nWorking hour\n09:00 to 17:30 Hrs\n[Mon to Fri, Except Holidays]\nDRDO ENTRY TEST :\nCEPTAM/PBM/2023/01\nStatus of Advt. :\nPublished\nClick here to check (Login) for final status of interviewed candidates for engagement of 11 posts of admin staff on purely contractual basis for DRDO Labs, Hyderabad.\nNew\nClick here to check (Login) short-listing status for engagement of 11 post of admin staff on purely contractual basis for DRDO Labs, Hyderabad\nApply Online for engagement of 11 posts of admin staff on purely contractual basis for DRDO labs, Hyderabad.\nDetailed advertisement and Curtain raiser for tenure based engagement of 11 posts of admin staff on purely contractual basis for DRDO labs, Hyderabad.\n(1.31 MB)"},
