{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/dearsenification-unit-dau", "content": "Back to Listing\nDearsenification Unit (DAU)\nLabs\nDefence Research Laboratory (DRL)\nTechnology Cluster\nSoldier Support System (SSS)\nIn recent days, the arsenic contamination in ground water of NE India is an alarming condition. DRL had developed Dearsenification unit to provide arsenic free drinking water\nMain Features\nRemoval Efficiency: Arsenic:    500 ppb to < 10 ppb [desirable limit set by WHO/BIS]\nIron: 50 ppm to < 0.3 ppm [desirable limit set by WHO/BIS]\nStructure: Cylindrical: Made of mild steel (MK I) & FRP (MK II)\nFiltration rate             : 200L/Hr"},
