{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/digital-trunk-unit-dtu#top", "content": "Back to Listing\nDigital Trunk Unit (DTU)\nLabs\nCentre for Artificial Intelligence & Robotics (CAIR)\nTechnology Cluster\nElectronics and Communication Systems (ECS)\nThe Digital Trunk Unit provides digital interface for the voice Trunks of the local exchange TIDEX to the Trunk exchange AES of the AREN communication network."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/directing-gear#top", "content": "Back to Listing\nDirecting Gear\nLabs\nNaval Physical & Oceanographic Laboratory (NPOL)\nTechnology Cluster\nNaval Systems and Materials (NS & M)\nEquipment for rotating and hoisting the transducer array for purposes of calibration and training of the sonar system."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/dolphin-ii#top", "content": "Back to Listing\nDolphin-II\nLabs\nDefence Electronics Research Laboratory (DLRL)\nTechnology Cluster\nElectronics and Communication Systems (ECS)\nIt is a submarine ESM system, capable of intercepting, detecting and classifying pulsed, CW, PRF agile frequency agile and chirp radars. It has features like 100 % probability of interception,high DF accuracy and is wide open in spectral and spatial domain. Status : Delivered two systems to Airforce and one system to Indian Navy."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/dr-b-k-das#top", "content": "Dr B K Das\nDistinguished Scientist & Director General - Electronics & Communication Systems (ECS)\nDr B K Das\n, Distinguished Scientist has been appointed as Director General (Electronics & Communication System) on 29th April 2022."},
