{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/dr-k-rajalakshmi-menon#top", "content": "Dr K Rajalakshmi Menon\nDistinguished Scientist & Director General - Aeronautical Systems (AS)\nDr K Rajalakshmi Menon\n, Distinguished Scientist has been appointed of DG (AS) on 27 August 2024."},
