{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/dr-samir-v-kamat#top", "content": "Dr Samir V Kamat\nSecretary, Department of Defence R&D and Chairman, DRDO\nDr. Samir V Kamat\nhas taken over as Secretary DDR&D and Chairman Defence Research and Development Organisation (DRDO) on 26th Aug 2022."},
