{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/drdo-water-testing-kit", "content": "Back to Listing\nDRDO water testing kit\nLabs\nDefence Research Laboratory (DRL)\nTechnology Cluster\nSoldier Support System (SSS)\nAscertaining the quality of drinking water is required to get rid of water borne diseases.  DRDO water testing kit is helpful to know potability of water in field conditions. It is cost effective and easy to carry in the field. The tests are semi-quantitative and are based on accept/ reject.\nMain Features\nEleven parameters (pH, total hardness, iron, chloride, fluoride, nitrate,\nresidual chlorine, sulphate, arsenic, TDS and faecal coliform bacteria can be tested with this kit) of drinking water can be assessed in field condition.\nIt carries high quality reagents to analyze 100 samples\nThe kit is provided with testing facilities for both physio-chemical and bacteriological parameters.\nIt can be performed by an unskilled person with little training"},
