{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/electrochromic-panel", "content": "Back to Listing\nElectrochromic Panel\nLabs\nDefence Laboratory Jodhpur (DLJ)\nTechnology Cluster\nNaval Systems and Materials (NS & M)\nA new Electrochromic Window Technology (smart window) provides protection from intense heat during hot and bright sunny days by reducing glares produced over the windows of buildings by way of modulating incoming light. The technology can be effectively utilized in the military vehicles."},
