{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/eocm-class-laser-system#top", "content": "Back to Listing\nEocm-Class Laser System\nTechnology Cluster\nElectronics and Communication Systems (ECS)\nDRDO has developed a portable dual-role EOCM laser system suitable for both anti-sensor as well as dazzling applications with an operational range of 2.5 km. It has a day/night sighting telescope target acquisition and weighs 30 kg (can be carried by two persons)."},
