{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/ergo-back-pack#top", "content": "Back to Listing\nErgo Back Pack\nLabs\nDefence Institute of Physiology & Allied Sciences (DIPAS)\nTechnology Cluster\nSoldier Support System (SSS)\nThis is extremely useful to carry military loads during marching, training and other operations with both hands free for postural stability while a separate pouch carries the rifle.\nSalient Features\nBack Pack is an ergonomically designed single compact unit with carrying capacity of 30-50 kilograms in the 75 liter volume.\nDesign allows the adjustability of the back support for different sizes.\nProvides compartmentalization for easy access of frequently used items.\nHydration pack of 1.5 liter capacity is built-in to provide drinking water."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/ergonomically-designed-light-weight-boots#top", "content": "Back to Listing\nERGONOMICALLY DESIGNED LIGHT WEIGHT BOOTS\nLabs\nDefence Institute of Physiology & Allied Sciences (DIPAS)\nTechnology Cluster\nSoldier Support System (SSS)\nFeatures:\nLight weight 1.5 kg with shock absorbing insole.\nSalient Features\nImproves balance and stability during standing and walking with and without external load.\nReduces risk of ligament injuries during walking.\nReduce transfer of force to lower extremity during running/walking\nDelayed onset of fatigue\nEnhance comfort /safety specially during heavy load carriage task.\nAnti-skid, anti-static, composite toe cap, anti-penetration, speed wearing facility.\nToT Holders:\n1) M/s\nProsafe\nInt Pvt Ltd. Plot E345, RIIC Ind Area, Bhiwadi – 301019, Contact: 9602525928\n2) M/s S\nuperHouse\nLtd, B-6 Site, UPSIDC Ind Area, Unnao – 209801, Contact: 9839808363\n3) M/s\nModel Exims\n, Plot No. A 32, Leather Technology Park, UPSIDC Banthar, Unnao, Contact: 0515 2824052\n4)M/s\nHomera Tanning Industries\n1-D (17-A-1) 150 Road Jajmau, Kanpur – 208010 Contact: 0512 2460701"},
