{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/gloves-ecw#top", "content": "Back to Listing\nGloves ECW\nLabs\nDefence Materials and Stores Research and Development Establishment (DMSRDE)\nTechnology Cluster\nNaval Systems and Materials (NS & M)\nGloves ECW provides protection for the hands of the soldiers from extreme cold weather effects in the temperature range up to -20°C  at high wind velocity."},
