{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/headquarter-cluster/director-general/human-resources", "content": "Smt U. Jeya Santhi\nOutstanding Scientist & Director General - Human Resources (HR)\nSmt U. Jeya Santhi, OS has been appointed as DG(HR), DRDO HQrs, New Delhi with effect from 01 July 2023."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/headquarter-cluster/director-general/planning-coordination-system-integration", "content": "Dr. (Smt) ChandrikaKaushik\nOutstanding Scientist & Director General - (PC & SI)\nDr. (Smt) ChandrikaKaushik, Scientist 'H' & Outstanding Scientist, took over as Director General (Production Coordination & Services Interaction (PC & SI) w.e.f. 1 June 2022."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/headquarter-cluster/director-general/resource-management", "content": "Dr. Manu Korulla\nOS & Director General, Resource & Management (R & M)\nDr. Manu Korulla\n, Outstanding Scientist has been appointed as DG (Resource and Management) w.e.f. 30 July 2024."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/headquarter-cluster/director-general/technology-management", "content": "Shri Mangal Lal Chand\nDistinguished Scientist & Director General (Technology Management)\nShri Mangal Lal Chand\n, Distinguished Scientist has been appointed as DG (Technology Management) on 30 January 2025."},
