{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/hi/nayaa-pankhaa", "content": "वापस सूचीबद्ध करने के लिए\nनया पंखा\nलैब्स\nगैस टरवाईन अनुसंधान स्थापना (जीटीआरई)\nप्रौद्योगिकी क्षेत्र\nविमान-चालान विज्ञानं प्रणाली (एयरो)\nThe high maneuverability combined with stealth requirements imposes very high inlet pressure distortion at the engine inlet. The fan being the first component in a gas turbine engine is subjected to this high inlet distortion which causes severe surge margin loss. Hence there is a need for a fan development with high distortion tolerance and surge margin. The increased surge margin with higher distortion tolerance would make this standard of fan more versatile for integration with higher thrust class engines. This fan also has anti-icing system.\nImages\nNew Fan - 3D Model"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/hi/news-corner#top", "content": "डीआरडीओ न्यूज़\nप्रेस विज्ञप्ति"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/hi/newsletter#top", "content": "डीआरडीओ न्यूज़ लैटर के लिए खोजें\nवर्ष\n- कोई भी -\n1980\n1981\n1982\n1983\n1984\n1985\n1986\n1987\n1988\n1989\n1990\n1991\n1992\n1993\n1994\n1995\n1996\n1997\n1998\n1999\n2000\n2001\n2002\n2003\n2004\n2005\n2006\n2007\n2008\n2009\n2010\n2011\n2012\n2013\n2014\n2015\n2016\n2017\n2018\n2019\n2020\n2021\n2022\n2023\n2024\n2025\n(1.95 MB)\nडीआरडीओ न्यूज़लैटर मई 2025\nआयतन:\n45\nसमस्या:\n05\nवर्ष:\n2025\nमहीना:\nमई\nदेखें\n(1.96 MB)\nडीआरडीओ न्यूज़लैटर अप्रैल 2025\nआयतन:\n45\nसमस्या:\n04\nवर्ष:\n2025\nमहीना:\nअप्रैल\nदेखें\n(1.72 MB)\nडीआरडीओ न्यूज़लैटर मार्च 2025\nआयतन:\n45\nसमस्या:\n03\nवर्ष:\n2025\nमहीना:\nमार्च\nदेखें\n(2.2 MB)\nडीआरडीओ न्यूज़लेटर फरवरी 2025\nआयतन:\n45\nसमस्या:\n02\nवर्ष:\n2025\nमहीना:\nफरवरी\nदेखें\n(1.99 MB)\nडीआरडीओ न्यूज़लैटर जनवरी 2025 (English)\nआयतन:\n45\nसमस्या:\n01\nवर्ष:\n2025\nमहीना:\nजनवरी\nदेखें\n(1.82 MB)\nडीआरडीओ न्यूज़लैटर दिसंबर 2024 (English)\nआयतन:\n44\nसमस्या:\n12\nवर्ष:\n2024\nमहीना:\nदिसंबर\nदेखें\n(2.05 MB)\nडीआरडीओ न्यूज़लैटर नवम्बर 2024 (English)\nआयतन:\n44\nसमस्या:\n11\nवर्ष:\n2024\nमहीना:\nनवंबर\nदेखें\n(2.11 MB)\nडीआरडीओ न्यूज़लैटर अक्टूबर 2024 (English)\nआयतन:\n44\nसमस्या:\n10\nवर्ष:\n2024\nमहीना:\nअक्टूबर\nदेखें\n(1.94 MB)\nडीआरडीओ न्यूज़लैटर, सितम्बर 2024 (English)\nआयतन:\n44\nसमस्या:\n09\nवर्ष:\n2024\nमहीना:\nसितंबर\nदेखें\n(1.37 MB)\nडीआरडीओ न्यूज़लैटर, अगस्त 2024 (English)\nआयतन:\n44\nसमस्या:\n08\nवर्ष:\n2024\nमहीना:\nअगस्त\nदेखें\nPagination\nCurrent page\n1\nPage\n2\nPage\n3\nPage\n4\nPage\n5\nPage\n6\nPage\n7\nPage\n8\nPage\n9\n…\nNext page\n››\nLast page\nLast »"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/hi/node/1231#top", "content": "वापस सूचीबद्ध करने के लिए\nTime Division Multiplex Exchange (TIDEX)\nप्रौद्योगिकी क्षेत्र\nइलेक्ट्रॉनिक्स एवं संचार प्रणाली (ईसीएस)\nTime Division Multiplex Exchange is an all digital exchange and serves as a mobile automatic telephone exchange, specially designed to work over Army Radio Engineered Network (AREN). It provides automatic switching for Subscriber, Grid Trunks and Universal Junction."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/hi/node/1241#top", "content": "वापस सूचीबद्ध करने के लिए\nSnake Robot\nप्रौद्योगिकी क्षेत्र\nइलेक्ट्रॉनिक्स एवं संचार प्रणाली (ईसीएस)\nThis robot demonstrates concepts of whole body locomotion. The snake robot has 14 active joints. Lateral undulation, side winding, and rolling gaits have been implemented on this robot. A color camera mounted in the hood of this robot provides video feedback."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/hi/node/1264", "content": "वापस सूचीबद्ध करने के लिए\nBridge Layer Tank (BLT) Arjun\nप्रौद्योगिकी क्षेत्र\nआर्मामेंट और कॉम्बैट अभियांत्रिकी (ए सी ई)\nBLT Arjun is a fast and reliable bridge laying system built on the Main Battle Tank Arjun, it is\n\ncapable of launching a 24 m bridge with in 10 minutes on any wet and dry obstacles, facilitating\n\nspeedy induction\nThe launching mechanism is supported by State-of-the-art hydraulic system for launching and\n\nretrieval operations. It has a separate auxiliary engine provided for contingencies\nSalient Features:\nSlide launch assault bridging system mounted on Arjun chassis\nLoad class of bridge superstructure : MLC-70\nSingle span, tread way type construction\nCrew of two – Commander and driver\nIndependent power unit for bridge launch/retrieval\nBridge Length: 24 m in steel and 26 m in Aluminum alloy\nLaunch/retrieval time: 10 min"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/hi/node/1316#top", "content": "वापस सूचीबद्ध करने के लिए\nCommand Information and Decision Support System (CIDSS)\nप्रौद्योगिकी क्षेत्र\nइलेक्ट्रॉनिक्स एवं संचार प्रणाली (ईसीएस)\nThe Command Information and Decision Support System facilitates storage, retrieval, processing (filtering, correlation, fusion) and visualization of tactical data and provide effective decision support to the commanders."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/hi/node/1325#top", "content": "वापस सूचीबद्ध करने के लिए\nDigital Trunk Unit (DTU)\nप्रौद्योगिकी क्षेत्र\nइलेक्ट्रॉनिक्स एवं संचार प्रणाली (ईसीएस)\nThe Digital Trunk Unit provides digital interface for the voice Trunks of the local exchange TIDEX to the Trunk exchange AES of the AREN communication network."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/hi/node/1330#top", "content": "वापस सूचीबद्ध करने के लिए\nProducts for the Civilian Sector\nप्रौद्योगिकी क्षेत्र\nइलेक्ट्रॉनिक्स एवं संचार प्रणाली (ईसीएस)\nCAIR_ICR, an Intelligent Character Recognition system for the automated processing of application forms with handwritten entries.\nIntelligent wheel chair for the physically challenged persons: - A low cost, semi-automatic, motorized wheel chair.\nSimulator based Laparoscopic surgery trainer based on VR and Haptics.\nSelective Compliant Assembly Robot Arm or Selective Compliant Articulated Robot Arm (SCARA) for educational institutions. The design focuses on low-cost manufacturing versatile actuation technologies, safety and open customized servo loops, kinematic calculations, and trajectory generation schemes, greatly aiding students in understanding fundamentals of robotic systems.\nRobots for hot slug handling: - A six axes articulated robotic system developed for NMRL for the transfer of a 600 degree Celsius hot slug from an induction furnace to a die casting machine.\nRobot for inspection of steam generator tubes of power plants.\nLanguage Independent Speaker Identification System (LISIS), functioning as the name suggests, for Central Forensic Science Laboratory (CFSL), Chandigarh."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/hi/node/1355#top", "content": "वापस सूचीबद्ध करने के लिए\nPDDS-X\nप्रौद्योगिकी क्षेत्र\nनौसेना प्रणाली और सामग्री (एनएस एंड एम)\nPortable Diver Detecon Sonar is a portable sonar system capable of detecting, tracking and classifying potential underwater threats like divers and diver delivery vehicles in shallow waters. The system can be deployed either outboard a ship or at any location in a harbor, typically beside a wall, pier or at the sea bottom.\nSalient Features\nCapable of detecting targets around 360° in azimuthal plane and up to 20° in elevation\nUseful for protection of waterside assets and installations with 24x7 surveillance\nDeployable wet-end unit electronics with associated launch and recovery mechanism\nProvides sonar picture in desired format and tactical picture with map overlay"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/hi/node/1359#top", "content": "वापस सूचीबद्ध करने के लिए\nHUMTAS-X\nप्रौद्योगिकी क्षेत्र\nनौसेना प्रणाली और सामग्री (एनएस एंड एम)\nHull Mounted Torpedo Alert (portable & versatile) System, is an extension to hull-mounted sonars on ships to provide state-of-the-art Torpedo Alert System. The system is capable of carrying out automatic torpedo detection, localization and tracking with reasonable accuracy. Subsequent to the localization of the torpedo, the system does a quick Target Motion Analysis for working out escape solutions."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/hi/node/1361#top", "content": "वापस सूचीबद्ध करने के लिए\nSMS-X\nप्रौद्योगिकी क्षेत्र\nनौसेना प्रणाली और सामग्री (एनएस एंड एम)\nSubmarine Sonar Suite is an integrated suite of sonar systems for installation onboard submarine. It is a compendium of multiple sensors for passive detection, which collates different characteristics of the same target and provides target data through information fusion.\nSalient Features\nAll-round superior performance with simultaneous panoramic surveillance coverage\nCapable of detecting, localizing, tracking multiple surface and subsurface targets"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/hi/node/1401#top", "content": "वापस सूचीबद्ध करने के लिए\nSoftware Defined Radio\nप्रौद्योगिकी क्षेत्र\nइलेक्ट्रॉनिक्स एवं संचार प्रणाली (ईसीएस)\nSDR is a secure indigenous system with legacy communication support and secure digital voice/data communication for Naval application with 3 channel (2V/UHF band and 1 HF band), 4-channel (2V/UHF band and 2L-band)for Tactical Communication and single channel operation in V/UHF (Manpack role) and UHF band (Handheld role)"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/hi/node/1483#top", "content": "वापस सूचीबद्ध करने के लिए\nDirecting Gear\nप्रौद्योगिकी क्षेत्र\nनौसेना प्रणाली और सामग्री (एनएस एंड एम)\nEquipment for rotating and hoisting the transducer array for purposes of calibration and training of the sonar system."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/hi/node/1485#top", "content": "वापस सूचीबद्ध करने के लिए\nMR Mount\nप्रौद्योगिकी क्षेत्र\nनौसेना प्रणाली और सामग्री (एनएस एंड एम)\nMagnetorheological fluid mount (MR Mount) is developed for isolating low frequency vibrations of on-board machinery from the hull of the ships. This real-time active vibration control mount consists of a load bearing elastomer, MR fluid chamber, MEMS based vibration sensor and a controller for closed loop feedback control mechanism. The mount can control low frequency vibrations both in passive and active modes. MR mount was manufactured by KELTRON, Kuttippuram. The mount is accepted by Indian navy for on-board applications."},
