{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/hi/node/23853", "content": "S. No.\nCentre Name\nResearch Verticals\nThrust Areas\n3\nDIA-RCoE, IIT Madras\n1.  Power Electronics and its Thermal Management (PETM)\n1. Material and Devices for High Power Applications\n2. Thermal Management of Power Electronic Components\n3. Robust Electronics Implementation for Mission Critical Applications\n2. Hydro-Dynamics, Control and Acoustics (HDCA)\n1. Low Noise Propulsion System\n2. Super Cavitating Torpedo\n3. Application Specific Unconventional Hull Structure\n4. Adaption of Advanced Technologies for Naval System Integration\n5. Structural Health Monitoring for Naval Systems\n6. Design of Lightweight Auxiliary Launching Craft (Air, Surface and Underwater)\n7. Fire Control System for Naval Platforms\n8. Underwater ISR and Communication\n9. Sonar Technologies\n10. Technologies for Naval Weapons and Countermeasures\n11. AL/ML based Technologies for Underwater Systems\n12. Naval Stealth Technologies.\n13. Non Acoustic Method of U/W Detection and Communication Technologies.\n14. Ship without Wakes\n15. Stable Naval Platform for Precision Firing\n16. Acoustically Silent Vessels\n3. Advanced Combat Vehicle Technologies (ACVT)\n1. Subsystem Level Research and Design of Combat Vehicles\n2. Simulation, Modelling and Digital Twin Technologies for Combat Vehicles\n3. Heavy Engine Technologies (>500 HP)\n4. Novel Integration Components & Technologies in Combat Vehicles\n5. Battle field situational awareness technology.\n6. Passive and Active based IFF (identification of friend or foe)\n4. High Power CW Laser Technology (> 10kW) (HPLT)\n1. Coherent Beam Combining\n2. Narrow Line Width Fiber Laser Sources\n3. Low Divergence Beam Formation and Maintenance\n4. Packaging of Laser Components & Integration\n5. Laser Matter Interaction\n5. Advanced Rare Earth Materials (AREM)\n1. Rare Earth Extraction from Indian Mineral Resources\n2. Magnetic Material for Defence Application\n3. Materials for Advanced Naval Sensors\n4. Materials for High Energy Densities Batteries\n5. Rare Earth Material based Fuel Cell Technology\n6. Materials for IR & MW Signature Control\n7. Recovery of Rare Earth Elements"},
