{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/index.php/faqs", "content": "Search your Query\nWhat is the full form of DRDO?\nDRDO stands for Defence Research & Development Organisation\nWhen was DRDO formed?\nDRDO was formed in 1958.\nHow can I join DRDO?\nDRDO has Recruitment and Assessment Centre (RAC) for Scientists (Group 'A' Class I Gazetted Post) recruitment and CEPTAM for recruitment of DRTC, Admin & Allied Cadre (Group ‘B’ and Group ‘C’) recruitment\nWhat are the pay scales of scientists/ technical cadre staff at various levels?\nFor complete information visit website\nhttps://rac.gov.in\nHow I can apply for JRF/SRF/RA/Apprentice Schemes in DRDO?\nEach individual lab publishes the requirements of manpower in what’s new section of DRDO website and in its lab page what’s new section as and when required.\nWhat are various modes of induction of scientists into DRDO system?\nLateral Recruitment for Scientist 'C' and above\nTalent Search Scheme (NRIs) for Scientist 'C' and above\nDeputation & Absorption\nI have some experience in Research & Development in the areas of interest to DRDO. Can I join DRDO at a higher post?\nApart from inducting Scientists 'B' (Entry Level), DRDO has following schemes for inducting Scientists 'C' and above (upto Scientist 'G') based on number of years of experience:\nLateral Recruitment for Scientist 'C' and above as per requirement of the Labs.(Through Advertisement)\nTalent Search Scheme (NRIs) for Scientist 'C' and above subject to suitability in DRDO Labs.\nHow can I contact DRDO for my recruitment related queries?\nGoto the page\nwww.rac.gov.in/feedback_form\nfor any recruitment related queries\nWhere are the labs of DRDO situated?\nDRDO labs are spread across India\nWhat is the procedure for doing summer Training in DRDO?\nYou can apply for summer training to Director of a suitable lab as per your discipline. You may visit DRDO website\nhttps://drdo.gov.in\nfor this purpose.\nI am NRI. What is the upper age limit to join DRDO?\nGrade\nUpper Age Limit\nC\n34\nD\n44\nE\n44\nF\n49\nG\n49\nAny experience required to be a scientist in DRDO?\nNo experience required for the post of Scientist B (entry level). And for other Scientist post, there is experience needed respectively as per guidelines. Goto website\nhttps://rac.gov.in\nI am a journalist, how can I get the information about latest news in DRDO?\nLatest news related to DRDO is updated in Press release section of DRDO website.\nI am a vendor how can I sell my products and services in DRDO?\nNew vendor can register online in DRDO website under Procurement section to provide products and services.\nI am research scholar, how can I know project sponsorships/scholarship/project grants opportunities?\nGo to the webpage\nwww.drdo.gov.in\nI am a research scholar, I want to publish my research paper in DRDO journals? What is the process?\nDRDO has separate web portal for publications. Visit\nhttps://publications.drdo.gov.in\nfor more information.\nIs DRDO Provide any amount for summer training?\nNo.\nDoes DRDO Lab outsource man power on contract basis for their project?\nYes. But, if there is requirement in project. Tender is published in website\nhttps://eprocure.gov.in/\nDid not find the information you were looking for?\nWhat code is in the image?\nEnter the characters shown in the image.\nGet new captcha!\nVertical Tabs\nRevision information\nRevision log message\nBriefly describe the changes you have made."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/index.php/feedback", "content": "Complete the below form to send us your complaint and suggestion. Your complaint and suggestions will be very much appreciated. If you provide us with your contact information, we will be able to answer your questions.\nFields marked with\n*\nare required.\nName\nContact Number\nEmail ID\nType\nSelect Type\nComplain\nSuggestion\nOthers\nOther Type\nSubject\nSelect Subject\nCareer\nProduct\nTechnology\nOthers\nOther Subject\nMessage\nEnter the Characters\nGet new captcha!\nVertical Tabs\nReset"},
