{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/index.php/hi/aeronautics-research-development/chaataravartatai-yaojanaaen#top", "content": "DRDO Scholarship scheme exclusively for girls-2021\nThe following students have been selected to receive the DRDO scholarship (exclusively for girls) for the year 2021\nLIST OF POST GRADUTE STUDENTS\nS.No\nName of Student\nInstitute\n1.\nUma Maurya\nDefence Institute of Advanced Technology, Pune\n2.\nMorvadia Aisha Ikbalbhai\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur\n3.\nShambhavi AS\nNitte Meenakshi Institute of Technology, Karnataka\n4.\nSushmasri G\nVisvesvaraya Technological University, Karnataka\nLIST OF UNDER GRADUTE STUDENTS\nS.No\nName of Student\nInstitute\n1.\nRanparia Hitika Vipulbhai\nAmrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham, Tamilnadu\n2.\nSrishti Gupta\nIndian Institute of Space Science & Technology, Thiruvananthapuram\n3.\nNavya Anil\nIndian Institute of Space Science & Technology, Thiruvananthapuram\n4.\nAnanya Elizabeth Thomas\nIndian Institute of Space Science & Technology, Thiruvananthapuram\n5.\nMaddineni Poojitha\nIndian Institute of Space Science & Technology, Thiruvananthapuram\n6.\nTanya Kumari\nIndian Institute of Space Science & Technology, Thiruvananthapuram\n7.\nApoora Kanti\nIndian Institute of Technology, Bombay\n8.\nSana Anesha Shabbeer\nIndian Institute of Technology, Hyderabad\n9.\nAnushree Shukla\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur\n10.\nAysha Siya P\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur\n11.\nGajula Geethanjali\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur\n12.\nSarvasiddi.lakshmi Ruthika Ram\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur\n13.\nHarshita Kaushal\nIndian Institute of Technology, Madras\n14.\nSomya Kumari\nMotilal Nehru National Institute of Technology, Allahabad\n15.\nVidhi Arya\nPunjab Engineering College, Chandigarh\n16.\nMehak Panwar\nPunjab Engineering College, Chandigarh\n17.\nKesia Ajith\nPunjab Engineering College, Chandigarh\n18.\nKanwalpreet Kaur\nPunjab Engineering College, Chandigarh\n19.\nLakshmi Manasa CN\nRashtreya Vidyalaya College of Engineering\nDRDO Scholarship scheme exclusively for girls-2020\nThe following students have been selected to receive the DRDO scholarship (exclusively for Girls) for the year 2020-21.\nLIST OF POST GRADUATE STUDENTS\nS No\nName of Student\nInstitute\n1.\nMane Suvidya Namdeo\nIndian Institute of Technology, Guwahati, Assam\n2.\nKarad Sneha Balaji\nIndian Institute of Technology, Guwahati, Assam\n3.\nBhavsar Mahima Tarunkumar\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur, Uttar Pradesh\n4.\nNisha Singh\nIIT Bombay, Powai, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India\n5.\nSweety Mondal\nBIT Mesra Campus Birla Institute of Technology, Mesra Ranchi, Jharkhand\nLIST OF UNDER GRADUATE STUDENTS\nS No\nName of Student\nInstitute\n1.\nShaik Rooma Sultana\nIndian Institute of Technology, Bombay\n2.\nVibha Karnad\nIndian Institute of Technology, Bombay\n3.\nSnehal Shangari\nIndian Institute of Technology, Bombay\n4.\nMili R Pillai\nIndian Institute of Technology, Bombay\n5.\nGitika Mittal\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur\n6.\nAditi Phogat\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur\n7.\nShrutikirti Singh\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur\n8.\nSwarnima Saxena\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kharagpur\n9.\nGauri Patki\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kharagpur\n10.\nAnwaya Anil\nIndian Institute of Technology, Madras\n11.\nMadhura Narayana Sabhahit\nIndian Institute of Technology, Madras\n12.\nMudapaka Amrutha\nIndian Institute of Technology, Madras\n13.\nDornala Hamsika\nIndian Institute of Technology, Madras\n14.\nT Prema Prescilla\nIndian Institute of Technology, Madras\n15.\nSuchitra Senthil\nIndian Institute of Technology, Madras\n16.\nBismanjyot Kaur Bindra\nPunjab Engineering College\n17.\nIshita Gupta\nPunjab Engineering College\n18.\nVasoya Meghana Arvindbhai\nPunjab Engineering College\n19.\nSamriddhi Mukhopadhyay\nIndian Institute of Engineering Science and Technology, Shibpur\n20.\nDandu Laxmi Kavya\nIndian Institute of Engineering Science and Technology, Shibpur\nDRDO Scholarship scheme exclusively for girls-2019\nThe following students have been selected to receive the DRDO scholarship (exclusively for Girls) for the year 2019-20.\nLIST OF POST GRADUATE STUDENTS\nS No\nName of Student\nInstitute\n1\nMs Nimisha Srivastava\nIIT, Madras, Chennai-600 036\n2\nMs Aditya Lakshmi ED\nDefence Institute of Advanced Technology (DIAT),Girinagar, Pune- 411025\n3\nMs Debanjali Dey\nDefence Institute of Advanced Technology (DIAT),Girinagar, Pune- 411025\nLIST OF UNDER GRADUATE STUDENTS\nS No\nName of Student\nInstitute\n1\nMs Meghna Dixit\nIIT, Bombay,Powai, Mumbai-400 076\n2\nMs Kriti Verma\nIIT, Bombay,Powai, Mumbai-400 076\n3\nMs Niranjana M\nIIT, Kharagpur,Kharagpur-721302\n4\nMs Drishti Darshan\nIIT, Madras,Chennai-600 036\n5\nMs Varija Doshi\nIIT, Madras,Chennai-600 036\n6\nMs Naimisha Sampath\nIIT, Madras,Chennai-600 036\n7\nMs Anjali Rawat\nIIT, Bombay,Powai, Mumbai-400 076\n8\nMs Bhagya S Prasanth\nIIT, Madras,Chennai-600 036\n9\nMs Titiksha Upadhyay\nIIT, Kanpur,Kanpur-208 016\n10\nMs Shreyashri Sarkar\nIndian Institute of Engineering Science and Technology (IIEST),Botanic Garden, Howrah, Kolkata,West Bengal- 711103\n11\nMs S A Yogeswari\nIIT, Madras,Chennai-600 036\n12\nMs Palvi\nPunjab Engineering College, Chandigarh,Sector-12, Chandigarh-160012\n13\nMs Mahima Arya\nIIT, Kharagpur,Kharagpur- 721302\n14\nMs Akriti\nPunjab Engineering College,Sector-12, Chandigarh-160012\n15\nMs Avantika Singh\nBengal Engineering and Science University, Botanic Garden, Howrah, Kolkata, West Bengal-711103\n16\nMs A Gayathri\nIIT, Kanpur,Kanpur-208 016\n17\nMs Peesa Santhi Prasanna\nIIT, MadrasChennai-600 036\n18\nMs JA Sakthi Shivani\nSASTRA University,Tirumalaisamudram Thanjavur– 613401\n19\nMs Sameera Rayapudi\nAmrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham,Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu- 641112\n20\nMs Nihaz Shaik\nSASTRA University,Tirumalaisamudram Thanjavur- 613401\nThe advertisement for the next financial year will be displayed in the DRDO/RAC/AR&DB website and also in National daily newspapers (Hindi/English) in the month of May-June 2020-21"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/index.php/hi/aeronautics-research-development/hamasae-sanparaka-karaen#top", "content": "संपर्क करें\nक्लस्टर/निदेशक का नाम\nवेब समन्वयक का नाम\nपद\nआधिकारिक ईमेल पता\nसंपर्क नंबर (लैंडलाइन)\nरक्षा अनुसंधान एवं विकास संगठन, डीआरडीओ मुख्यालय। एनेक्सी, चतुर्थ मंजिल, कमरा न. 411 पुरानी लास्टेक बिल्डिंग, मेटकाफ हाउस, सिविल लाइंस, दिल्ली-110054\nGp Capt Lalit Kumar Khulbe\nAdditional Director\nlalit[dot]khulbe[at]gov[dot]in\nTele .: 011-23902743\nFax No.: 011-23902794"},
