jvasa[at]iitm.ac.in\nMember\n12.\nDr Arvind Kumar Gupta\nScientist ‘G’ (Retired)\nEmail: arvindkumargupta227[at]yahoo.com\nMember\n13.\nProf Palani Iyamperumal\nAnand\nProfessor\nMechatronics and Manufacturing,\nIIT, Indore\nEmail: palaniia[at]iiti.ac.in\nMember\n14.\nDr. Mithun Palit\nScientist ‘F’\nDefence Metallurgical Research Laboratory (DMRL), Kanchan Bagh,  Hyderabad-500058\nMobile: 9490166743\nEmail: mithun[dot]dmrl[at]gov[dot]in\nMember\n15.\nDr Swati Biswas\nScientist 'F'\nGTRE, Bengaluru\nTel: 080-2540343\nEmail: swati[dot]gtre[at]gov[dot]in\nMember\n16.\nDr Sanjay Kumar Pandey\nScientist ‘F’\nAR&DB, DRDO Hq. Annexe,\nMetcalfe House, Delhi\nEmail: skpandey[dot]hqr[at]gov[dot]in\nMember Secretary\nA High Temperature Materials Initiative with a Focus on Gas Turbine Materials (GTMAP)\nGTMAP Programme initiated in 2014 for supporting research & development especially on Gas Turbine Materials & Processes. The management structure of this programme is as follows:\nManagement Structure\nApex Board/ Apex Programme Reviewing Team, APRT\nCHAIRMAN\nProf Amol A Gokhale, IIT Bombay\nCO-CHAIRPERSON\nDirector General (Aeronautical System) & DS\nCO-CHAIRMAN\nDirector General (Technology Management) & DS\nMEMBERS\nChairman, Steering Committee of AR&DB\nIFA (R&D), DRDO\nDirector, DMRL, Hyderabad\nDirector, GTRE, Bengaluru\nChairman, Materials & Manufacturing Panel, AR&DB\nChairman, Structures Panel, AR&DB\nProgramme Director & Coordinator, GTMAP Programme\nSecretary, AR&DB\nPERMANENT INVITEES:\nDr Amit Bhattacharjee, Sc ‘G’, DMRL, Hyderabad, Chairman- PARC (Materials in Bulk)\nDr Dipak Das, Sc ‘H’, DMRL, Hyderabad, Chairman- PARC (Materials in Small Volumes)\nProgramme Director- Dr M Phani Surya Kiran, DMRL, Hyderabad\nMember Secretary- Secretary, AR&DB, DRDO\nPROJECT ASSESSMENT & REVIEW COMMITTEES (PARCs)\nA.PARC (Materials in Bulk)- Members\nDRDO\nDr Amit Bhattacharjee, Sc ‘G’, DMRL, Hyderabad\nChairman\nDr. Parthasarathi Hans, Sc ‘G’, GTRE, Bangalore\nCo-Chairman\nDr A Venugopal Rao, Sc ‘G’ DMRL, Hyderabad\nMember\nShri R Sankarasubramanian, Sc ‘F’, DMRL Hyderabad\nMember\nDr Mithun Palit, Sc ‘F’, DMRL, Hyderabad\nMember\nSri Nandam Srinivas Rao, Sc ‘F’, DMRL, Hyderabad\nMember\nSri A Manjunath, Sc ‘F’, GTRE, Bengaluru\nMember\nDr Vijay Uttam Rao Petley, Sc ‘F’, GTRE, Bengaluru\nMember\nMs. Srishanthi Potluri, Sc ‘F’, GTRE, Bengaluru\nMember\nProf Ramesh Babu, IIT, Madras\nMember\nDr PD Mangalgiri, Visiting Professor, IIT, Kanpur\nMember\nDr T Jayakumar (Retd.) Scientist, IGCAR, Hyderabad\nMember\nPARC (Materials in Bulk): Thrust areas\nSingle Crystal / Directionally Solidified Alloys\nTurbine / Compressor Disc Alloys / Powder Metallurgy Alloys\nMetal (titanium) matrix composites\nExploratory studies on usage of intermetallic alloys\nJoining/repair technologies applicable to Ni & Ti alloys\nAdditive Manufacturing\nStructural Ceramics and Ceramic Matrix Composites, SiC Fibers etc.\nHigh Temperature polymer composites\nChemical /Electro-chemical manufacturing processes\nManufacturing processes for ceramics and ceramic matrix composites\nUltrasonic machining, Hybrid machining etc.\nFlow forming of hollow shafts in superalloys\nAbrasive flow forming, Magnetic pulse forming etc.\nLaser processing of materials\nPrediction of mechanical properties in titanium and superalloys\nModelling of evolution of transformation texture, slip transfer across phases etc. in Ti alloys\nModelling microstructural evolution in Ni base superalloys\nMaterial degradation modelling\nLife prediction methodologies\nElastic-Plastic modeling of damage accumulation\nDamage tolerance in materials and structures\nAdvanced NDT methodologies with emphasis on Ni, Ti alloys and ceramic matrix composites\nHigh strain rate behaviour of engine materials\nDesign of Experiments and Statistical treatment of test data for design use\nB.PARC (Materials in Small Volumes)- Members\nDRDO\nDr Dipak Das, Sc ‘H’, DMRL, Hyderabad\nChairman\nDr. Parthasarathi Hans, Sc ‘G’, GTRE, Bangalore\nCo-Chairman\nDr M Manivel Raja, Sc ‘F’, DMRL, Hyderabad\nMember\nDr MD Zafir Alam, Sc ‘F’, DMRL, Hyderabad\nMember\nShri Somasurendra Kumar Balam, Sc ‘E’, GTRE, Bangalore\nMember\nDr Barad S Ganpatrao, Sc ‘G’, GTRE, Bengaluru\nMember\nDr Sanjib Majumdar, Sc ‘G’, BARC, Mumbai\nMember\nDr MM Nayak, Visiting Prof CeNSE, IISc, Bengaluru\nMember\nPARC (Materials in Small Volumes): Thrust areas\nSliding wear and Erosion resistant coatings\nOxidation and thermal barrier coatings\nMultilayer coating architectures\nMechanical reliability of coatings\nNon-destructive evaluation of fresh and service exposed coatings\nCoating lifetime prediction\nMechanical behaviour in small volumes\nSensor materials and sensors for sensing vibration, temperature and strain\nSensors for full field surface pressure on the aerofoils and vanes\nSensors for tip gap measurement, axial gap between static and rotating parts\nExpert Review Panel\nDRDO\na\nProf Vikram Jayaram, IISc Bengaluru\nb\nProf B Gurumoorthy, IISc, Bengaluru\nc\nDr AK Gogia, Retd Sc, DMRL, Hyderabad\nd\nDr K Bhanu Sankara Rao, P&W Chair, SEST, UoH, Hyderabad\ne\nProf Rahul Mitra, IIT, Kharagpur\nf\nDr M Vijayakumar, Retd. Sc, DMRL, Hyderabad\ng\nShri R Pradyumna, Sc ‘G’, DMRL, Hyderabad\nh\nDr K Parthiban, Retd Sc, GTRE, Bengaluru\ni\nShri BVAR Patnaik, Sc ‘G’, GTRE, Bengaluru\nj\nDr CM Manjunatha, Scientist, NAL, Bengaluru\nk\nDr Vijayarajulu, ADA, Bengaluru\nl\nDr S Tarafdar, Scientist, NML, Jamshedpur\nm\nSri BR Satyan, Retd, Director, CMTI, Bengaluru\nn\nDr SL Mannan, Retd Scientist, IGCAR, Bengaluru\no\nProf KSR Murthy, MVSR Engg. College, Hyderabad\nPropulsion Panel\nPanel Chairman\nDr BS Subhash Chandran\nDS (Retd) Consultant, DRDL, Hyderabad\nEmail Id:\nbssc[dot]prop2022[at]gmail[dot]com\nsubhashchandranbs721[at]gmail[dot]com\nPanel Members\nDRDO\nS.No\nMember Name\nDesignation\nOfficial Address\nTele/Fax\n1.\nShri Ajay Pratap\nScientist ‘H’\nGTRE Bengaluru\nEmail: ajaypratap.gtre[at]gov[dot]in\nCo-Chairman\n2.\nDr B