{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/index.php/popular-science-and-technology-series#top", "content": "Search for PST\n(4.23 MB)\nCorona's battle with DRDO (Hindi)\nYear of Publishing:\n2020\nView\n(5.46 MB)\nMission Shakti Ebook (Anti-Satellite Missile)\nYear of Publishing:\n2020\nView\n(1.96 MB)\nToxicology and Human Life\nYear of Publishing:\n1989\nView\n(1.11 MB)\nSuper Vision\nYear of Publishing:\n1982\nView\n(1.16 MB)\nSatellites\nYear of Publishing:\n1989\nView\n(7.28 MB)\nSagar main Sangram (Hindi)\nYear of Publishing:\n1991\nView\n(5.2 MB)\nKindling Creativity\nYear of Publishing:\n1996\nView\n(4.77 MB)\nGuided Missiles\nYear of Publishing:\n1990\nView\n(3.86 MB)\nElectronic Warfare\nYear of Publishing:\n1988\nView\n(9.3 MB)\nComputers and Defence Applications\nYear of Publishing:\n1991\nView\n(4.36 MB)\nComposite Materials\nYear of Publishing:\n1990\nView\n(9.86 MB)\nBattle with Barnacles\nYear of Publishing:\n1987\nView"},
