{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/index.php/rti-cell/home", "content": "DRDO is placed in Second Schedule of RTI Act, 2005 and is exempt from disclosure of information under Section 24(1) except information pertaining to the allegations of corruption and human rights violations.\nDuring the Period 2024-2025:\nNo. of RTI Applications received and disposed are 491 and 472 respectively.\nNo. of RTI First Appeals received and Order issued are 68 and 65 respectively.\nNo. of RTI Second Appeals received and disposed are 17.\nNo. of questions asked in the Parliament and replies given are 178 and 129 respectively.\nHow To Submit RTI Application (Hindi)\n732 KB\nPublic Authorities Under DRDO\n651 KB\nRTI Act, 2005 (Ministry of Law and Justice)\n1.2 MB Hindi and English\nExemption under RTI Act, 2005\n157 KB Hindi and English\nGuidelines for Information Seekers (English & Hindi)\n773 KB\nHow to submit RTI Application\n732 KB\nFrequently Asked Questions on RTI\n293 KB\nSuo Motu disclosures u/s 4(1)(b) of the ACT\n265 KB\nImportant Decisions/orders\n915 KB"},
