{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/advanced-systems-laboratory-asl#top", "content": "Vision\nThrust on design & development and flight evaluation of various types of missile systems\nMission\nTo develop state of the art core technologies required for design & development of missile systems."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/aerial-delivery-research-and-development-establishment-adrde#top", "content": "Vision\nTo be globally competitive in Technologies and Systems Development related to Parachute, Decelerators and Lighter-than-Air systems\nMission\nDevelop the entire range of Parachutes and Lighter-than-Air Systems to meet the needs of Services. Enhance expertise and infrastructre for undertaking Integrated Systems Development Task.\nProducts\nAerostat Health Monitoring System\nAircraft Arrester Barrier System\nAircrew Parachutes\nAkashdeep Medium class Aerostat\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/aeronautical-development-establishment-ade#top", "content": "Vision\nTo be a Centre of excellence for development of state-of-the-art Unmanned Air Vehicles and Aeronautical Systems for the Services\nMission\nTo develop and lead to production of Unmanned Air Vehicles and Aeronautical Systems to meet the needs of the Services and progressively enhance the Technological Infrastructure and Capabilities\nProducts\nABHYAS\nAvionics Part Task Trainer (APTT) for upgraded MIG-27\nCombat Aircraft Systems- Systems & Subsystems for LCA\nComputerized Pilot Selection System (CPSS)\nView All\nPhotos\nVisit of Dignitaries to LCA Full Mission Simulator at ADE\nSuccessful Test Firing of Quick Reaction Surface-to-Air Missiles (QRSAM)\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/armament-research-development-establishment-arde#top", "content": "Vision\nTo design and develop Competitive conventional armament systems and related technologies Leading to total self-reliance of the nation.\nMission\nTo equip the armed forces with world class, affordable weapon systems through innovation, research, integration, test and evaluation and transfer of technology to build a strong technology base for future developments through synergy amongst national research labs, academia and public / private industry participation.\nProducts\n500kg Prefragmented Bomb\n120 mm Armaments for ARJUN MBT\n120 mm Penetration Cum Blast (PCB) AND Thermobaric (TB) Ammunition For MBT Arjun\n125mm FSAPDSMk-II Ammunition\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/centre-air-borne-system-cabs#top", "content": "Vision\nThe VISION of the lab is to “Meet Technological Challenges of Airborne Surveillance Systems”.\nMission\nThe MISSION is to “Develop Key Technologies and Infrastructure for building efficient and cost-effective Airborne Surveillance Systems”.\nProducts\nAirborne Early Warning and Control (AEW&C)\nGround Exploitation System (GES)\nIdentification Friend or Foe (IFF) MK XII (S) with Mode 4 Capability\nPhotos\nInauguration of Security Complex by Shri M S Easwaran, DS, PGD(AEW and C) and Director, CABS on 9th May 2017\nInauguration of the hanger for FTB and AWACS (I) by Dr. S Christopher, Chairman and Secretary DD (R and D) on 9th May 2017\nInauguration of the Administrative Block by Dr. C.P. Ramanarayanan, DS, DG(Aero) on 9th May 2017\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/centre-artificial-intelligence-robotics-cair#top", "content": "Vision\n“Adding value to information\nEnabling battle space dominance”\nMission\n“To add value to information by delivering dependable information systems to the Defence services for battle space dominance, by developing domain & technologies that ensure relevance, security, safety, resiliency, survivability and trustworthiness enabling the use of these systems in mission critical applications with required guaranties of assured performance”\nProducts\nAir Defence Control and Reporting System (ADC & RS)\nAutomatic Electronic Switch (AES)\nAutonomous Navigation System\nAutonomous Search Robot\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/centre-fire-explosive-and-environment-safety-cfees#top", "content": "Vision\nTo evolve into a Centre of Excellence in the field of Fire Science & Engineering, Explosive and Environment Safety & to provide integrated safety advice and services to MoD establishments.\nMission\nR&D in Fire Science & Engineering, Explosive and Environment Safety; Regulatory Authority for Fire, Explosive and Environment Safety in MoD establishments; and Nodal agency for implementation of Safety Healthy Environment (SHE) & Disaster Management for DRDO.\nPhotos\nCentre for Fire, Explosive and Environment Safety (CFEES)\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/combat-vehicles-research-development-estt-cvrde#top", "content": "Vision\nBe a Centre for Design & Development of State-of-the-art Armored Fighting Vehicles (AFVs) for the Army & Spin-offs for Other services (Air force, Navy & CAPF).\nMission\nDesign, develop and lead to production of Tracked Armoured Vehicles, Specialist Vehicles and Combat Aircraft systems to meet the needs of the services. Build technological capabilities in critical areas including test & evaluation of Combat systems.\nProducts\n130mm SP Gun - CATAPULT\n5 kW Brushless DC Generating System for LCA Tejas\n5 kW brushless DC Generating system for LCA Tejas\nAircraft Mounted Accessory Gear Box\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/defence-bio-engineering-electro-medical-laboratory-debel#top", "content": "Vision\nTo become a world class laboratory in the development of protective and life support equipment and biomedical devices and systems specific to service combatants\nMission\nTo carry out design, development and evaluation of state-of-the-art life support and biomedical systems and devices.\nCoordinate user evaluation and induction into Services.\nTransfer technology for productionization.\nExplore utilization of spin-off technologies for civilian application.\nProducts\nCBRN Defence\nCombat Free Fall System (CFF)\nHAPO chamber"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/defence-electronics-application-laboratory-deal#top", "content": "Vision\nBe a center of excellence in the field of Military Communications & Surveillance Technologies.\nMission\nDevelopment of Software Based Radios, Anti‐Jam Data Links, Secure Satcom Systems, Millimeter Wave Communication & Surveillance Systems.\nProducts\nCombat Net Radio (CNR)\nCommunication support in disaster relief :\nConnecting Continents-Mission Antarctica:\nData-Link System – Nishant UAV\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/defence-electronics-research-laboratory-dlrl#top", "content": "Vision\nBe a Centre of excellence in the field of Electronic Warfare.\nMission\nDesign and develop state-of-the art integrated Electronic Warfare systems for the Services and achieve self-reliance in critical technologies and components.\nProducts\nAEW&C (CSM) and Indigenous ESM & RWR Systems for AEW&C\nAJANTA\nCATCH\nCOIN-A\nView All\nPhotos\nDLRL Annual Day Celebrations 18th Nov 2018\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/defence-geoinformatics-research-establishment-dgre#top", "content": "Vision\nTo be a leader in the development of critical technologies for enhancing combat effectiveness with a focus on terrain & snow based challenges.\nMission\nTo create a geospatial information system for operational planning & military intelligence\nTo provide cutting edge engineering solutions for ensuring safe movement of troops in all kind of terrain with a focus on avalanches & landslide5\nTo build AI enabled intelligent solutions for deployment"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/defence-institute-high-altitude-research-dihar#top", "content": "Vision\nTo transform Defence Institute of High Altitude Research into a world class leader in cold arid agro-animal technologies.\nMission\nDIHAR will evolve novel inputs, with focused R&D in cold arid agro-animal technologies, which will enhance the agro-animal productivity to enhance the availability of fresh foods for troops in Ladakh, the most difficult terrain of the world.\nProducts\nCattle Development\nDouble Humped Camel for carrying load\nHigh  altitude adapted cattle\nHigh  altitude adapted chicken\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/defence-institute-physiology-allied-sciences-dipas#top", "content": "Vision\nBe a center of excellence in the field of environmental physiology and human factor research.\nMission\nOptimization of human performance in different occupational environment conditions using physiological, biochemical, nutritional and ergonomic approach.\nProducts\nActive Ear Defender\nAlocal Cream for Prevention of Cold Injuries\nErgo Back Pack\nERGONOMICALLY DESIGNED LIGHT WEIGHT BOOTS\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/defence-institute-psychological-research-dipr#top", "content": "Vision\nDIPR will emerge as a centre of excellence in Military Psychology.\nMission\nTo provide psychological support to the armed forces in selection, training, effective man-machine interface and motivation to enhance mental health and operational efficiency of the armed forces.\nProducts\nComputerized Pilot Selection System (CPSS)"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/defence-laboratory-dlj#top", "content": "Vision\nTo become a centre of excellence in Camouflage, Desert Sciences & Nuclear Radiation Management Technologies.\nMission\nTo achieve excellence and self reliance in the areas of Multispectral Camouflage and Low Observable Technologies, provide solutions to Desert related problems, and develop Nuclear Radiation Sensor Technologies and Applications of Radioisotopes.\nProducts\nBeta light\nContamination Monitoring Systems\nElectrochromic Panel\nFast Setting and High Strength Polymer Concrete Composites (PolyCC) For Rapid Repair of Runways\nView All\nPhotos\nDLJ Photo Gallery\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/defence-materials-and-stores-research-and-development-establishment-dmsrde#top", "content": "Vision\nTo be a Centre of Excellence in the area of Strategic Non-Metallic and speciality Materials and Technology Leader to make the country Self Reliant.\nMission\nDevelopment of advanced / smart / intelligent polymers, elastomers, advanced composites, high performance fuels / lubricants, engineering fluids, advanced ceramics / CMCs, advanced gels, specialty materials, functional materials and advanced paints & coatings.\nDesign and development of lightweight, ultra-high-performance materials and technologies for Personal Protective Gears.\nDevelopment of advanced fibres & technical textiles for strategic applications e.g. CBRN, High altitude clothing, camouflage & stealth, fire & thermal resistance, ballistic protection, etc.\nDevelopment of new generation nanomaterials for applications in multi-functional textiles / composites, micro / nano-electronics,  flexible electronics, energy harvesting, energy storage, etc.\nProducts\nACF based CBRN Suit\nAdvanced Riot Protection Suit\nAnti Personal Mine Blast Protective Suit (APMBPS) For Indian Army\nBallistic Helmet\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/defence-metallurgical-research-laboratory-dmrl#top", "content": "Vision\nTo provide complete materials solutions for defence systems\nMission\nTo develop advanced materials, innovative processes, technologies and carry out related product engineering, supported by basic and applied research\nProducts\nAA2219 Alclad Sheets and Plates for Missile Applications\nAl Alloy Sheets & Plates for Military Bridging System\nAl Alloy Sheets & Plates for Superstructures in Naval Warship\nAluminium Alloy Armour Plates for Infantry Combat Vehicle\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/defence-research-development-establishment-drde#top", "content": "Vision\nBe a centre of excellence for chem-bio defence.\nMission\nDesign and develop state-of-the-art technologies and products for chem-bio defence and establish state-of-the-art repository and test & evaluation facilities for developed products.\nProducts\nAnthrax Detection Kit\nAutoject Injectors MK-II\nBiodigester\nBiodigester for Indian Railways\nView All\nPhotos\nDRDO SCIENTIST OF THE YEAR AWARD-2017\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/defence-research-development-laboratory-drdl#top", "content": "Vision\nEmpower the nation with state-of-the-art indigenous systems and technologies for missile based weapon systems deployable from underwater, sea, land and air based platforms.\nMission\nDesign, development and leading-to-production of systems and technologies for missile based weapon systems deployable from underwater,sea, land and air based platforms.\nEnsure product support, product upgrade and end-of-life replacement.\nEstablish critical infrastructure and facilities for design, testing and evaluation.\nProducts\nAkash\nASTRA\nHelina\nMan-Portable Anti Tank Guided Missile\nView All\nPhotos\nInauguration of new buildings/facilities\nDRDL Annual Day Celebrations\nVisit of dignitaries at DRDL\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/defence-research-laboratory-drl#top", "content": "Vision\nTo be a centre of excellence in technology development for troops for jungle warfare and border areas of North East (NE) India.\nMission\nTo provide world class technologies/ products/ knowledge/ services to Armed Forces to enhance their performance in jungle warfare and border areas of NE India.\nProducts\nChilli Grenade (CapsigrenadeTM)\nChilli Spray (CapsisprayTM)\nDearsenification Unit (DAU)\nDRDO Biotoilet for Floating conditions\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/defence-scientific-information-documentation-centre-desidoc", "content": "Vision\nTo provide essential science and technical research, development information rapidly, accurately and reliably to support DRDO’s Scientists’ needs.\nMission\nTo establish an integrated resource centre and state-of-the-art information management system encompassing knowledge centre, publishing, e-services, printing and multi-media\nTo collaborate with national and international institutions/academia/ organizations for cooperative partnerships to improve upon quality and bring visibility to DRDO's R&D Publications\nTo introduce new innovative Defence Research Journals for the benefit of R&D community\nTo improve the role of DESIDOC's Defence Science Library by reinventing library functions and services with focus on the perception and expectation of the users\nEmbracing advanced technologies to provide library and information services on emerging digital platforms\nIntroducing digital imprint of DRDO to connect with the scientific and civil society through online community\nBuilding a \"single window\" facilitation by improving the quality of print-media, multi-media and network services\nProducts\nDefence Life Science Journal (DLSJ)\nDefence Science Journal (DSJ)\nDESIDOC Journal of Library & Information Technology (DJLIT)\nDRDO E-Library\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/drdo-young-scientist-laboratory-artificial-intelligence-dysl-ai#top", "content": "Vision\nNo active record(s) available currently for this section.\nMission\nNo active record(s) available currently for this section."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/drdo-young-scientist-laboratory-dysl-at#top", "content": "Vision\nTo make India self-reliant in developing asymmetric warfare technologies which are subtle, unconventional and cost effective to combat new age threats by tactically engaging with its disruptive capabilities.\nMission\nTo design and develop unconventional technologies by promoting collaborative research within the country through academia and industry to enhance the capabilities of the armed forces in asymmetric warfare scenario."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/drdo-young-scientist-laboratory-dysl-ct#top", "content": "Vision\nEmphasis on incorporating cognitive technologies into existing System like classical radar, radio, surveillance systems to make them more agile to the environment.\nMission\nTo develop state of art advanced Cognitive technologies."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/drdo-young-scientist-laboratory-dysl-qt#top", "content": "Vision\nTo become a center of excellence by achieving technical capabilities and self-reliance on Quantum Technologies.\nMission\nTo explore Quantum Technologies and improve the TRL from 1 to 5 and subsequently to 9 in Quantum Computing, Communications and Sensing technologies."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/drdo-young-scientist-laboratory-smart-materials-dysl-sm#top", "content": "Vision\nTo be a pioneer in the field of smart materials and provide technology solutions for defence.\nMission\nAccelerated discovery and insertion of smart materials\nTo provide smart materials solutions for defence sector"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/electronics-radar-development-establishment-lrde#top", "content": "Vision\nTo create a Centre of Excellence in the field of Radar Systems and Technologies fulfilling Nation’s Defence / Security needs.\nQuality Policy\nLRDE is committed to the indigenous development of modern RADAR systems through an effective Quality Management System.\nQuality Objectives\nDevelop modern RADAR systems to meet User requirements.\nEnhance capabilities in Technologies and Systems Engineering.\nImplement Quality Management System and enhance Quality through continual Improvement.\nISO 9001:2015 Certification\nMission\nTo Design and Develop state-of-the-art Radar Systems meeting the current and futuristic requirements of the Tri-Services, Para-Military forces, Intelligence and Strategic Missions.\nTo establish indigenous production capability through Industry partnership to achieve total self-reliance in the field Radars.\nTo promote in-house Research, engage Academia& Industry to build competence towards creating a Centre of Excellence in the field of Radar Technologies.\nTo provide operationalization and life cycle support to the Users.\nProducts\n2D Low Level Light Weight Radar (LLLR): BHARANI MK I\n3 D Medium Range Surveillance Radar for Airforce- Rohini\n3D Low Level Light Weight Radar Aslesha Mk I\n3D Surveillance Radar for Indian Navy -Revathi\nView All\nPhotos\nProducts Gallery\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/gas-turbine-research-establishment-gtre#top", "content": "Vision\nTo be a centre of excellence for aero gas turbine design and development of related technologies.\nMission\nTo design, develop and integrate advance technologies, state of art aero gas turbine engines and their derivatives for defence forces.\nProducts\nAdvanced Full Authority Digital Electronic Controller\nEngine Fuel Control System\nKaveri\nKaveri Core Engine – Kabini\nView All\nPhotos\nPhoto Gallery\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/high-energy-materials-research-laboratory-hemrl#top", "content": "Vision\nBe a centre of excellence in the field of High Energy Materials and associate technologies.\nMission\nDevelop expertise and technologies relating to High Explosives, Propellants and Pyrotechnics and transfer the technologies to industry, enhance the infrastructure and scientific understanding to meet the future challenges.\nProducts\n500 kg GP Bomb\n81 mm Anti-thermal Anti-laser (AT-AL) Smoke Grenade\n84 mm High Temperature Suffocating Smoke (HTSS) Ammunition\nAdvanced Air Defence (AAD) Warhead\nView All\nPhotos\nBIMSTEC MILEX-2018\nWorld Quality Day\nInternational Women’s Day 2019\nHEMRL Raising Day 2019\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/institute-nuclear-medicine-allied-sciences-inmas#top", "content": "Vision\nThe Vision of INMAS has been identified as to be a center of excellence in biomedical and clinical research with special reference to ionizing radiation.\nMission\nThe Mission of INMAS is clinical research in nuclear medicine and non-invasive imaging methods with a focus on biological radio-protectors and thyroid disorders\nProducts\nINMAS Products"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/institute-systems-studies-analyses-issa#top", "content": "Vision\nTransform ISSA into centre of excellence in system analysis, modelling & simulation of defence systems to meet the challenges of the present and future requirements of the armed forces.\nMission\nConduct system study and develop high quality integrated software for system analysis & decision support in application areas of Sensors & Weapons, Electronic Combat, Land & Naval Combat, Air-to-Air Combat and Air Defence for effective use by DRDO and Services for Design, Mission Planning, Tactics development and Training.\nProducts\nLand Wargaming Systems\nNaval Wargaming System\nSystems Analysis Tools\nPhotos\nMulti-media Library-ISSA\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/institute-technology-management-itm", "content": "Vision\nTo be a center of excellence in Technology Management training and research.\nMission\nTo provide world class training in the field of Technology Management.\nTo strive for continuous improvement of faculty, infrastructure and management systems.\nTo carry out research in the areas of Technology Management for enhancing Techno-Managerial skill of human resources.\nPhotos\nVISITORS TO ITM\nMid Career Training Augmentation (MITRA) (18 Apr-13 May 2022)\nInauguration of Advance Work Study Course (AWS-28) on  07 Mar 2022\nOnline Course on R and D Management for Newly Promoted TO ‘C’ during  31 Jan -04 Feb 2022\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/instruments-research-development-establishment-irde#top", "content": "Vision\nTo achieve excellence in the fields of Optics & Electro-optical Instrumentation with a commitment to provide high quality Instruments.\nMission\nTo design and develop state-of-the-art Night Vision Devices & Thermal Imagers.\nTo design and develop compact Laser Based Instruments.\nTo design and develop Integrated Electro-optical Surveillance and Fire Control Systems.\nTo carry out research in the area of Photonics.\nProducts\nCommander’s TI (MK-II) for T-72 Tanks & BMP II\nCommander’s TI for T-90 Tank\nElectro-Optical Fire Control System for armoured vehicles and naval ships\nGap Measuring Device Mk III\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/integrated-test-range-itr", "content": "Vision\nTo be a trusted Integrated Test Facility, delivering reliable and quality services to all customers.\nMission\nTo achieve excellence in service quality and reliability\nTo attain global best practices and become a world class test range\nTo be a technology driven and efficient organization\nTo encourage ideas, talents and value systems\nTo work with Vigour, Dedication and Innovation with Total Customer Satisfaction as the ultimate goal\nTo promote work culture that fosters Individual Growth, Team Spirit and Creativity to overcome challenges and attain goals\nTo contribute towards community development and Nation Building"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/naval-materials-research-laboratory-nmrl#top", "content": "Vision\nTo be the Centre of Excellence for Development of Materials for Naval Applications & Energy Systems\nMission\nTo develop Air Independent Propulsion (AIP) system for Naval Submarine & Fuel Cell technologies.\nTo provide scientific solutions for all categories of materials & related technologies for Indian Navy.\nTo undertake research projects on strategic materials for Indian Navy.\nProducts\nAmorphous Nano-structured Erosion Corrosion Resistant Coating\nAnticorrosive and Antifouling Paint for application under Immersed Condition\nCorrosion-resistant catalyst for acid Fuel cells\nDeck Overlay Coating\nView All\nPhotos\nRepublic Day\nRepublic Day\nNational Science Day\nNational Science Day\nNational Safety Week\nNational Safety Week\nSwachhta Hi Seva Pakhwada-2018\nSwachhta Hi Seva Pakhwada-2018\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/naval-physical-oceanographic-laboratory-npol#top", "content": "Vision\nTo be a centre of excellence for the design and development of underwater surveillance systems.\nMission\nTo design, develop, integrate and lead to production of sonar systems for Naval applications. Development of technologies for underwater surveillance systems and oceanographic research for Anti Submarine Warfare applications.\nProducts\n3G UWACS\nABHAY\nAIDSS\nALTAS\nView All\nPhotos\nSports\nRajbhasha Implementation\nInternational Day of Yoga\nCourses\nView All"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-and-establishments/naval-science-technological-laboratory-nstl#top", "content": "Vision\nTorpedoes, underwater targets and decoys, ship fire control systems and underwater mines with competitive and cutting edge technologies.\nHydrodynamics with expertise for supporting indigenous design of marine vehicles and provide comprehensive facilities.\nStealth technology for naval platforms.\nMission\nDesign, development and evaluation leading to production of Torpedoes, Mines, Targets, Decoys, Fire Control Systems and induction into services and establish test facilities for the same.\nEstablish world-class hydrodynamic test Facilities for evolving Design Criteria through model tests for surface and sub-surface vehicles and torpedoes.\nDevelop Structural Design Capabilities and Materials for mitigation of radar, infrared, magnetic, acoustic and electric signatures leading to stealthier platforms.\nProducts\nAnti Torpedo Decoy System (ATDS)\nAutonomous Underwater Vehicle (AUV)\nHelicoptor Fire Control System\nIntegrated Anti Submarine Warefare Complex\nView All\nPhotos\nYoga Day-2022\nWomens Day-2022\nNational Technology Day-2022\nNational Science Day-2022\nView All"},
