{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/director/proof-experimental-establishment-pxe", "content": "Shri Subodha Kumar Nayak\nDirector, Proof & Experimental Establishment (PXE)\nShri Subodha Kumar Nayak\n, Scientist 'G'  has been appointed as Director, PXE with effect from 19 Jan 2024"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/director/research-centre-imarat-rci", "content": "Shri Anindya Biswas\nScientist 'H' & Director, Research Centre Imarat (RCI)\nShri Anindya Biswas\n, Scientist H, RCI, Hyderabad has been appointed as Director, RCI, Hyderabad with effect from 01 July 2023. Shri Anindya Biswas is widely known for his significant contributions in indigenous design, development and successful demonstration of advanced avionics and technologies for defence applications.He is a graduate in Electronics and Telecommunications from Bengal Engineering College, Shibpur and M. Tech in Electronics and Communication Engineering from IIT Kharagpur.\nHe played a vital role in indigenous development of seeker-based guidance systems for Anti-Tank guided missiles and precision guided systems.\nAs Director\n, he is spearheading Research Centre Imarat (RCI), an avionics laboratory of Dr APJ Abdul Kalam Missile Complex steering the design, development and delivery of avionics and wide range of missiles & guided weapon systems for defence and aerospace applications in India. His sustained R&D contributions have been transformative for indigenization of critical Missile and Aerospace technologies and has strengthened defence industry eco-system in the country.\nFor his distinguished contributions, he has been conferred with DRDO Young Scientists Award in 2002.He has also been conferred with Scientist of the Year Award in 2016 for his ingenious efforts and contributions towards the development of IIR Seeker and terminal guidance systems."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/director/research-development-establishment-rdee", "content": "Dr. Makarand Ganesh Joshi\nOS and Director, Research & Development Establishment (Engrs.)\nDr. Makarand  Ganesh Joshi\n, Scientist ‘H’, assumed office of Director, Research and  Development Establishment (Engineers), Pune on 01st June 2023."},
