{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/interaction-with-other-labs/defence-bio-engineering-electro-medical-laboratory-debel", "content": "Due to its technologically diverse range of activities, DEBEL has successful interactions with sister DRDO laboratories/ Establishments, Services and academic institutions, and public and private sector agencies in the areas mentioned below:\nDefence Research & Development Organization\nADA\nADE\nADRDE\nCABS\nCAIR\nCEMILAC\nCVRDE\nDEAL\nDIAT\nDIPAS\nDIHAR\nDRDE\nDMRL\nDRL\nINMAS\nLRDE\nNSTL\nVRDE\nRCI\nServices institutions\nAFMC\nHAMRC\nIAM\nINHS Aswini\nASTE\nNFTC\nCSIR Laboratories\nMany CSIR labs like NAL, CMTI, NCL, CGCRI and CSIO\nAcademic Institutions and Research Institutions/Associations\nIISc, IITs, and many other engineering & medical colleges, Research associations like ATIRA, BTRA, SITRA and NITRA\nPublic Sector Undertakings\nHAL, Bangalore\nBEL\nPrivate Sector\nSeveral private sector industries like M/s Larsen & Toubro, M/s Meastro Mediline, Mumbai; Arvind Mills, Ahmedabad; Alok Industries, Vapi; Jayashree Textiles, Hooghly; M/s Aeronav, New Delhi, M/s Arnaf, New Delhi, M/s Sure Safety, M/s Frontier, M/s Tan Enterprises, M/s Murali Enterprises, M/s Liberty, Raksha Polycoats, Pune; VSSL, Mumbai; JLD, Mumbai; Surya Aerotech, Gurugram; Shakti Enterprises, Faridabad; and many others."},
