{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/interaction-with-other-labs/defence-laboratory-dlj", "content": "Intra Cluster\nCVRDE, DARE, ADA, , DRDE, CAIR, VRDE, R&D Engineers, CEMILAC, RCI, ASL, ADE, SSPL and ADRDE.\nInter Cluster\nDMSRDE, DMRL, NSTL\nAcademia\nIITs at Bombay, Delhi, Kanpur, Jodhpur, Madras, Kharagpur and BHU, and other institutions including JNCASR, Bengaluru, IIsc. Bengaluru, JNV University, Jodhpur, BARC, Mumbai, CIPET, Ahmedabad, CGCRI, Kolkata and BITS Goa.\nIndustry\nM/s PLA Mumbai, Nucleonix Hyderabad, BEL Pune, Agile Mtecy Jodhpur, Defsys Solutions Gurgaon, Surface International, ERCON Composites, Permionics membrance Vadodra, ION exchange Delhi"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/interaction-with-other-labs/defence-materials-and-stores-research-and-development-establishment-dmsrde", "content": "Interaction with Other Labs\nCollaborations\nDMSRDE shares the expertise and infrastructure available nationwide for mutual benefit through collaborative and sponsored R&D programmes on the design and development of newer materials, devices and sub-systems having potential for future applications. For pursuing these activities, DMSRDE actively interacts with DRDO sister labs, National Scientific Laboratories, Academic Institutions, Professional Institutes, R&D Centers of Repute, Industries etc. besides other DRDO Labs. Presently, several collaborative R&D programmes are in progress with following institutions.\nInter-Cluster\nDRDL, Hyderabad\nCHESS, Hyderabad\nRCI, Hyderabad\nASL, Hyderabad\nADE, Bangalore\nR&D, Pune\nSSPL, Delhi\nCFEES, Delhi\nGTRE, Bangalore\nINMAS, Delhi\nIntra-Cluster\nNMRL, Mumbai\nDL, Jodhpur\nNSTL, Vishakhapatnam\nDMRL, Hyderabad\nIndustry\nAdonis Avero, Kanpur\nAeon Technologies Pvt. Ltd, Bengaluru\nAjit Chemicals Pvt Limited, Kanpur\nAtharva Laboratories Private Limited, Gautam Buddha Nagar\nATMASTCO Ltd, Bhilai\nAVR Enterprises, Kanpur\nBajaj Engineers & Consultants Co., Bahadurgarh\nBata India Limited, Gurugram\nConcord Helmet and Safety Products Private Limited, Tiruchrappali\nFrontier Defense Solution Pvt. Ltd, Kolkatta\nG M Trading Company,Roorkee\nGanesh Footwears Pvt Ltd, Delhi\nGlocot Industries Pvt. Limited, Sonepat\nHindustan Metal Industries, Gwalior\nHindustan Petroleum Corporation Limited, Delhi\nIndraprastha Petrochemicals (P) Ltd, Delhi\nIntegrated Defence Products Pvt Ltd, Kanpur\nJ. K. Fennar (India) Ltd., Madurai\nKrishna Allied Industries Pvt. Ltd., Mumbai\nKusum Industries Pvt. Ltd., Jaipur\nM/s. Net Plast Pvt. Ltd., Kanpur\nManjushree Technopack Limited, Bengaluru\nMars Auto Pvt. Ltd., Kanpur\nMineral Oil Corporation, Kanpur\nMKU Ltd, Kanpur\nNalin Rubber Private Limited, Jamshedpur\nOrcas Systems Private Limited, Gurugram\nP.D. Scientific Industries (P) Ltd., Kanpur\nPal Enterprises, New Delhi\nPragati Defence Systems Pvt. Ltd., Bilaspur\nProtiqa India Pvt. Ltd.,Delhi\nProtochem Industries Pvt Ltd, Mumbai\nPukhrayan Industries, Kanpur\nRG Industries, Palwal\nSaxon Fluid Sealing Devices, Bhiwadi\nSB Equipments LLP, New Delhi\nSBL Plastics Pvt Ltd, New Delhi\nSci Tech Services, Hooghly\nShakti Engineering Industries, Gwalior\nShakun Enterprises, Kanpur\nShiva Industries, Kanpur\nShree Kedar Nath Polymers, Kanpur\nSMK Petrochemicals (P) Ltd, Sonepat\nSMPP Pvt Ltd., New Delhi\nSri Durga Engineering Works(P) Ltd., Kanpur\nSS Rubbers Pvt Ltd, Hyderabad\nSureka International, Kanpur\nSwastik Oil Products Manufacturing Navsari Pvt Ltd., Mumbai\nSynthetic Moulders Ltd., Kolkatta\nVega Aviation Products Pvt. Ltd.,Belagavi\nVetri Engineering, Salem\nVijay Aluminium Works, Kanpur\nVinni Chemicals Pvt Ltd, Delhi\nViraj Syntex Pvt Ltd , Kanpur\nAcademia\nJawaharlal Nehru Centre for Advanced Scientific Research (JNCASR), Banglore\nIndian Institute of Science, Bangalore\nIndira Gandhi Centre for Atomic Research, Kalpakkam\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kharagpur\nIndian Institute of Technology, Delhi\nIndian Institute of Technology, Chennai\nIndian Institute of Technology, Mumbai\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur\nIndian Institute of Technology, Roorkee\nIndian Institute of Technology, Patna\nIndian Institute of Technology, Ropar\nIndian Institute of Technology, Indore\nIndian Institute of Technology (Indian School of Mines), Dhanbad\nIIT-Banaras Hindu University, Varanasi\nRegional Research Laboratory, Bhopal\nHarcourt Butler Technological Institute, Kanpur\nCentral Institute of Plastic Engineering & Technology, Chennai\nCentral Institute of Plastic Engineering & Technology, Lucknow\nCentral Institute of Plastic Engineering & Technology, Bhopal\nCentral Institute of Plastic Engineering & Technology, Bhuvaneshwar\nCentre for Advanced Technology, Indore\nDelhi Technical University\nCGCRI, Kolkata\nMNNIT, Allahabad\nPunjab University, Chandigarh\nBirla Institute of Technology, Mesra\nUniversity of Petroleum and Energy Studies, Dehradun\nIndian Institutes of Science Education and Research (IISER), Kolkatta\nUttar Pradesh Textile Technology Institute, Kanpur\nMalaviya National Institute of Technology, Jaipur\nM S Ramaiah University of Applied Sciences (RUAS), Bengaluru\nGovernment Women Engineering College, Naseribad\nBundelkhand Institute of Engineering & Technology(BIET), Jhansi\nNIT, Patna"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/interaction-with-other-labs/defence-metallurgical-research-laboratory-dmrl#top", "content": "Interaction with Other Labs\nDMRL being a premier materials laboratory has interactions with academia, other R&D laboratories as well as industry. Some of our collaborators are given below:\nAcademia\nIndian Institute of Science, Bangalore\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kharagpur\nIndian Institute of Technology, Madras\nIndian Institute of Technology, Bombay\nIndian Institute of Technology, Delhi\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kanpur\nBanaras Hindu University, Varanasi\nPSG College of Engineering, Coimbatore\nHyderabad Central University, Hyderabad\nNIT, Warangal\nBE College, Sibpur\nR&D Laboratories (DRDO)\nGTRE, Bangalore\nDRDL, Hyderabad\nASL, Hyderabad\nRCI, Hyderabad\nARDE, Pune\nTBRL, Chandigarh\nNSTL, Vishakapatnam\nNPOL, Kochi\nMTRDC, Bangalore\nCVRDE, Avadi\nVRDE, Ahmednagar\nsspl, Delhi\nDMSRDE, Kanpur\nNMRL, Ambernath\nDRDE, Gwalior\nPXE, Balasore\nR&D Laboratories (Non-DRDO)\nARCI, Hyderabad\nCECRI, Karaikudi\nCGCRI, Kolkata\nNAL, Bangalore\nNML, Jamshedpur\nBARC, Mumbai\nIGCAR, Kalpakkam\nVSSC, Thiruvananthpuram\nNational Institute of Interdisciplinary Science and Technology, Thiruvananthpuram\nRaman Centre for Applied and Interdisciplinary Sciences, Kolkata\nIndustry\nMIDHANI, Hyderabad\nHAPP, Tiruchirapalli\nOF, Ambajhari\nHAL, Bangalore\nHAL, Koraput\nKMML, Kollam\nWalchandnagar Industries, Walchandnagar\nSAIL, Rourkela, Bhilai, Durgapur, Bokaro\nHEC, Ranchi\nEssar Steel, Hazira\nBHEL"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/interaction-with-other-labs/defence-research-development-establishment-drde", "content": "Collaborations\nInter-cluster\nAt present one project is in progress. Project under NBC Defence Technology, has been successfully completed during last 05 years in which DRDE Gwalior was nodal lab. In addition to this, DRDE was participating lab in 03 other projects with other cluster laboratories.\nIntra-cluster\nOne Project under NBC Defence Technology and 02 Projects on Biothreat mitigation technologies have also been successfully completed during last 05 years with DRDE Gwalior as Nodal lab.\nIndustry\nDRDE Gwalior has developed various products and technologies related to NBC, vector control and human waste disposal technologies. These technologies have been transferred to industry partners for commercialization through MOU for development contracts or Licensing Agreement for Transfer of Technology (LATOT). Technologies have been transferred to Total 153 industry partners including 52 for NBC Products, 75 for Bio digester and 12 for vector control products, 24 for Microbial water testing bottle and diagnostic kits through Expression of Interest (EOI).\nAcademia\nIn areas of research work relevant to lab research work, DRDE Gwalior has collaboration with academic institutions and national research institutions through grant in aid projects sanctioned by Directorate of ER&IPR, DRDO HQ New Delhi; LSRB, DRDO HQ or CARS Projects. During last five years, DRDE has collaboration with academic institutions i.e. CSIR, JALMA, ATIRA etc. from 2014-2018, 22 Tasks/ Subprojects were sanctioned."},
