rtment of Nuclear Medicine (All India Institute of Medical Sciences) collaborative Research on the Production, Quality Assurance and Clinical Trials for 99mTc-labelled-Methionine and 68Gallium-Methionine\nChristian Medical College, Vellore\nCurie Centrer St Johns Hospital Campus, Bangalore\nDharamshila Cancer Hospital, New Delhi\nDr. BalabhiaNanavati Hospital, Mumbai\nGovt. of Himachal Pradesh (Directorate of Health)\nGuru TegBahadur Hospital, Delhi\nIndo-American Hospital, Hyderabad\nLady Harding Medical College &Kalawati Saran Hospital (Dept. of Pediatrics).\nManipal Institute of Neurological Disorders, Bangalore\nMaulana Azad Medical College, Delhi\nNehru Homeopathic Medical College & Hospital, New Delhi\nNizam Institute of Medical Sciences, Hyderabad\nRajeev Gandhi Cancer Hospital, New Delhi\nRBTB Hospital, Delhi\nResearch & Referral Hospital, Delhi Cantt\nSafdarjung Hospital, New Delhi\nTata Memorial Hospital, Mumbai\nVidyasagar Institute of Mental health & Neuro sciences, New Delhi\nInstitute of Home Economics,\nHindu Rao Hospital, Delhi\nIndustries\nAlimco, Kanpur\nATL, Noida\nCipla Ltd, Mumbai\nDr. Reddy’s Lab, Hyderabad\nIndident, Faridabad\nRakshaPolycoat, Pune\nRanbaxy Research Labs, Gurgaon\nShantha Biotech, Hyderabad\nSun Pharma (under consideration)\nHindustan Antibiotics Ltd., Pimpri, Pune"},
