{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/interaction-with-other-labs/instruments-research-development-establishment-irde", "content": "I4M (IRDE, Industry, Institute Interaction Meet)-2018\nIRDE and OSI, Dehradun Chapter has conducted a joint event I4M-2018 at IRDE, Dehradun on 25 Oct. 2018. I4M-2018 was focused to bring out the present capabilities and future plan of IRDE for the development of technologies relevant to Electro-optics where handshake is sought from the industries and institutions. This event provided a platform for the Industries to know the requirements of IRDE and the Academia for focused research. About 50 Industries and more than 320 participants attended the event from IRDE & other DRDO labs, Industries, Institutions and production partners. The main outcomes of the event are\nIndustries shown interest to takeup the ToT of the IRDE products.\nToT of the 02 products Commander’s TI for T-90 and Holographic Sight have been given to BEL-MC and private Industries, respectively.\nIt was suggested by Industry a Long term Plan towards EO products should be prepared and translated into research through Industries/ Academia under Make in India.\nAcademia-for R&D\nIIT-Mumbai/Kanpur/Delhi/Kharagpur/Roorkee.\nIISc. Banglore.\nCentral Manufacturing Technology Institute (CMTI), BANGALORE\nGuru Jambheswar University of Science & Technology, HISAR (HARYANA)\nCSIR- Central Electronics Engineering Research Institute (CEERI), Pilani\nCSIR- National Physics Laboratory (NPL), etc\nCharusat Space Research & Technology Center (CSRTC), Changa\nCSIR-CSIO, Chandigarh\nAcademia-for R&T Schemes\nIIT-Mumbai/Kanpur/Delhi/Kharagpur/Roorkee.\nIISc. Banglore.\nUttarakhand Technical University, Dehradun\nGraphic Era University, Dehradun\nDoon University\nSister Labs (DRDO)\nDRDL, Hyderbad\nRCI, Hyderabad\nARDE, Pune\nNPOL, Cochin\nDEAL, Dehradun\nSSPL, Delhi\nDLRL, Hyderabad\nTBRL, Chandigarh\nCVRDE, Chennai etc.\nIndustries\nOrdnance Factory Board\nBEL- Pune/Banglore/Chennai/Kotdwar/Machilipatnam,\nSEH Hydrabad\nTata Power SED, Mumbai,\nVEM technologies, Hyderabad etc.\nBenEngg, Bengalore\nParas Defence, Mumbai"},
