{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/interaction-with-other-labs/scientific-analysis-group-sag", "content": "Intra-cluster\nANURAG\nSSPL\nMTRDC\nCAIR\nJCB\nIndustry\nBEL\nECIL\nITI\nAcademia\nRegular interaction is going on with the following Institutes, sometimes for time-bound projects, CARS projects, MOC, etc.\nIISc Bangalore\nIIT Bombay\nIIT Delhi\nIIT Kharakpur\nIIT Chennai\nIIT Roorkee\nIIT Bhubaneswar\nISI, Kolkata\nISI, Delhi\nNIT Warangal\nJadavpur University\nIDST, Delhi\nC-DAC, Noida\nAmrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham, Coimbatore\nAmrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham, Kollam\nIIIT Delhi\nIIIT Hyderabad\nCR Rao Institute\nBE College, Kolkata\nKIIT College of Engg., Gurgaon\nHarish Chandra Institute, Allahabad"},
