{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/interaction-with-other-labs/terminal-ballistics-research-laboratory-tbrl", "content": "TBRL extends its test and evaluation facility to all its sister DRDO laboratories, Academic institutes, Other Govt installation and Private developers (for defence sector) under make in India movement of Govt of India. As work center and prject partners it is interacting with many laboratories in time bound manner. MoU and research products through various routes are also modes of interaction.\nInteraction with Other Labs\nADRDE, Agra\nARCHEM, Hyderabad\nARDE, Pune\nCGCRI,Kolkata\nCSIO, Chandigarh\nDMRL, Hyderabad\nETDC, Mohali\nHEMRL, Pune\nHP University, Shimla\nIDST, Delhi, Pune, Hyderabad\nIISc, Bangalore\nIIT, Bombay\nIIT, Chennai\nIIT, Delhi\nIIT, Kanpur\nMTECH, Chandigarh\nIPR, Gandhinagar\nRCI, Hyderabad\nDRDL, Hyderabad\nASL, Hyderabad\nPEC University of Technology (Punjab Engg. Collage), Chandigarh\nPanjab University, Chandigarh\nPunjabi University, Patiala\nR&DE(E), Pune\nThapar University, Patiala\nVSSC, Trivendrum\nMany Other DRDO Labs"},
