{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/lab-awards/aerial-delivery-research-and-development-establishment-adrde", "content": "National Awards\nShri Bhado Oraon, STA ‘B’, awarded DRTC award for Excellence in Technical Support by DRDO HQr for the year 2018.\nShri Ashutosh Kumar, Scientist D, awarded as Young Engineers Award by INSARM Society Hyderabad for the year 2018.\nShri Manoj Kumar Chilkoti, SAO-II, awarded Best Performance award by DRDO HQr for the year 2016.\nShri Ravi Krishna, Scientist ‘D’, awarded Young Scientist award by DRDO HQr for the year 2016.\nPath Breaking Research & Technology Award from Prime Minister of India to Dr. S.C. Sati, Director and Team in 2014\nYoung Scientist of the year award to Shri Ajeet Gaur, Sc 'C' in 2013\nAgni Award for excellence in self-reliance to Dr. S.C. Sati, Director and Team in 2012\nDr VM Ghatage Award by Aeronautical Society of India to Dr. S.C. Sati, Director and Team in 2011\nYoung Scientist of the year award to Shri Sudhakar Prasad, Sc 'C' in 2011\nAgni Award for excellence in self-reliance to Shri. A.K. Saxena, Sc 'F' with LRDE Team in 2011\nDRDO Award for performance excellence to Shri. Balraj Gupta, Director, Shri S.P. Singh, Sc 'F', A.M. Gupta, T.O. 'B' with ADE Team in 2011\nYoung Scientist Award by Institution of Engineers (IEI) to Shri Gaurav Singh, Sc 'D' in 2011 during 24th National Convention of Textile Engineering for his contribution in development of Heat Stabilizer Textile, Impulse Heat Sealing Machine and Technology of Laminated Fabric\nDr VM Ghatage Award by Aeronautical Society of India jointly to Shri I Husain, Sc G and Shri KK Thaper, Sc 'F' for Development and Productionisation of Balloon Barrage System in 1997\nDRDO Technology Award to Shri JK Tyagi, Sc G and his team for Indigenous Development of Aircraft Arrester Barrier System in 1995\nDr VM Ghatage Award by Aeronautical Society of India to Shri JK Tyagi, Sc 'G' and his team for Design and Development of Para Recovery System for Pilotless Target Aircraft in December 1992\nSilver Shield, for Indigenisation of Brake Parachute for MiG-21 Aircraft by the Board of Awards for Import substitution in December 1985\nSilver Shield, for Indigenisation of Brake Parachute for S22 Aircraft by the Board of Awards for Import Substitution in December 1981."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/lab-awards/aeronautical-development-establishment-ade#top", "content": "Shri Ashok Rangan, OS &amp; team received DRDO Performance Excellence Award 2017.\nShri Dilip Y, Sc-G received DRDO Scientist of the Year Award 2017.\nShri Rajiv Kumar Singh, Sc-E was the winner of DRDO Online Innovative Challenge 2017.\nShri Arvind Bobby Alphonse, Sc-D received Young Scientist of the Year Award 2017.\nSmt Ushadevi Sanjeev, PS received Best Performance Award 2017.\nShri APVS Prasad, Sc ‘G’ received the DRDO Scientist of the Year Award 2016.\nShri BP Shashidhara, Sc ‘G’ received the DRDO Scientist of the Year Award 2015.\nShri G Magesh, Sc ‘E’ received the DRDO Young Scientist Award 2015.\nSmt MR Lakshmi, TO ‘D’ received the DRDO Best Performance Award 2015.\nShri P Srikumar, OS and Former Director, ADE received National Aeronautical Prize for 2014 awarded by the Aeronautical Society of India .\nADE was bestowed with the Silicon Trophy for the Best Systems Lab for 2014.\nTeam Nirbhay won the DRDO Performance Excellence Award in 2014.\nDr. M Suresh, Sc ‘E’ received DRDO Scientist of the year Award 2014.\nShri R Ramalingam, Sc ‘C’ received the DRDO Young Scientist Award 2014."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/lab-awards/armament-research-development-establishment-arde", "content": "Awards\nSr. No\nAward/Amount\nAwardees\nContributions\nYear\n1\nDRDO Cash Award (Rs.5000)\nCol Rs Deswal & Team of 11\nFor invertion & suggestion in 81 mm Illg.\n1982\n2\nBest Sub-system Lab Award (Silicon Trophy)\n1984\n3\nDRDO Cash Award (Rs.10000/-)\nPU Deshpande & 5 others\n105 mm FSAPDS Shot Dev of\n1985\n4\nSilver Medal for Best Scientist of the Year\nPU Deshpande , Maj D Kapil & Dr Acharyalu\n1986\n5\nDRDO Cash Award for the year 1986(Rs10000/-)\nAir Cmde BS Narasimhan & 13 others\nInd. Dev of RTU & Fuze for 1000 lb mk 6/9 bomb\n1986\n6\nDRDO Cash Award for the year 1987(Rs10000/-)\nSB Sarkar, Sc'F' and 10 others\nDes & Dev of 5.56 mm SA\n1987\n7\nDRDO Cash Award for the year 1988-89(Rs10000/-)\nAS Rajagopal & Team of 35\nfor Dev of Cluster Weapon\n1988\n8\nDRDO Cash Award for the year 1988-89(Rs10000/-)\nGO Capt NN Shah and team of 21\nfor successful Dev of 3 kg Practice Bomb\n1989\n9\n\"IGMDP Award (AGNI) Rs.1,20,000/-)\"\nMR Patkar, Sc'E' and 119 others\nIGMDP warhead dev.\n1989\n10\nDRDO Technological Award (Rs.10000/-)\nKN Pandey & 35 Others\nDev of sub-systems for MBRS PINAKA\n1990-94\n11\nDRDO Technological Award (Rs.10000/-)\nAK Ghosh, ScD' and 3 others\nDatabase for Aerodynamic analysis of projectiles & rockets\n1990-94\n12\nDRDO Technology Award (Rs.10000/-)\nSL Kohli and 9 others\nDev of 1000 kg class warheads for 'Prithvi'\n1995\n13\nTechnology Transfer & Assimilation Award (Rs.20000/-)\nPN Gadhikar & 15 others\nPZT Elements for Sonar\n1996\n14\nBest System Lab Award (Silicon Trophy)\nSilicon Trophy - ARDE\nBest System Lab\n1996\n15\nTechnology Transfer & Assimilation Award (Rs.100000/-)\nfor INSAS 5.56 Rifle\n5.56 INSAS weapons successful ToT & proudcitonsation at RF Ishapore\n1997\n16\nAgni Award\nShri M Natarajan and Team Brig VD Prabhu (Team Member)\n1998\n17\nPerformance Excellence\nSL Kohli, Sc'F'\nfor Prithvi\n1998\n18\nScientist of the Year\nAM Datar Sc'F'\nfor INSAS\n1998\n19\nYoung Scientist\nMV Ramesh Kumar, Sc 'C'\nfor SAM\n1998\n20\nBest Performance (DRTC)\nMS Thengdi, STA\nfor Pinaka\n1998\n21\nScientist of the Year\nSureshchandra\nfor Armament Ballistics\n2001\n22\nAgni Award\nVS Hashilkar\nfor MBT Arjun Armt\n2001\n23\nPerformance Excellence\nR Bhattacharya & Team\nfor Dev of Pinaka\n2002\n24\nAgni Award\nJK Bansal & Team\nfor CSS for LCA\n2003\n25\nBest Performance (DRTC)\nDaniel Mathew\nfor Pinaka\n2003\n26\nAgni Award\nAS Rajagopal and his team\nWH for Missile\n2005\n27\nAgni Award\nShri SM Nirgude, Sc ‘F’ & Team\nfor Influence Mine Mk II\n2006\n28\nScientist of the Year\nDr Mahendra Jha, Sc 'F'\n2007\n29\nYoung Scientist\nDayal Saran Saini, Sc 'C'\n2007\n30\nYoung Scientist\nPramod Dhande, Sc 'C'\n2008\n31\nBest Performance (DRTC)\nSK Jha, STA A\n2008\n32\nSmt Chandaben Mohanbhai Patel Industrial Research Award for Women Scientists\nMs Charulata Mahajan, Sc F\n2008\n33\nPinaka Award for Performance Excellence\nShri DP Bagad, Security Officer\n2017"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/lab-awards/centre-air-borne-system-cabs", "content": "Awards & Recognitions\nBoth Officers and Non Officers in CABS endeavor to give their best in terms of their efforts and performance. This is evident from multitude of recognitions received by CABS within DRDO and outside.\nCertificate of Recognition for women at Aero India 2019\nOutstanding Women Scientist /Engineer Technologist from AeSI for 2018\nDRDO Best Performance Award in 2018, 2017, 2016, 2009, 2007 and 1998\nDRDO Silicon Trophy in 2017\nDRDO Agni Award for excellence in Self Reliance in 2016, 2013 and 2006\nDefence Technology Spin Off in 2016\nDRDO Young Scientist Award in 2016, 2011 and 2008\nDRDO Award for Performance Excellence in         2015\nDRDO Scientist of the Year Award in 2015, 2010 and 1985\nDRDO Award for path breaking Research / outstanding technology Development in 2012\nIETE-IRSI (83) Award in 2008\nDr VM Ghatage Award in 2004\nRajiv Gandhi Environment Award in 2004\nK Suryanarain Rau Memorial Award in 2000\nDr. Biren Roy Space Science and Design Award in 1998\nDRDO Outstanding Contribution Award in 1995 and 1992\nISAMPE Award for Outstanding Design and Development in1995\nNational Aeronautical Prize in 1991\nDRDO Outstanding Achievement Award in 1983\nBest Performance Award – 2015 - Shri G Prabhu Shankar, TO ‘B’\nScientist of the Year Award – 2015 – Dr. K Rajalakshmi Menon, Sc G\nDRDO Award for Performance Excellence – 2015 – Ms. Suma Varughese, Sc H and Ms. Backialakshmi Sc G & Team\nDRDO Award for Performance Excellence – 2015 – Ms. Suma Varughese, Sc H and Ms. Backialakshmi Sc G & Team\nBest Performance Award – 2016 – Shri Anand Babu, AA ‘A’, Shri Devender Reddy, VO\nBest Performance Award – 2016 – Shri Anand Babu, AA ‘A’, Shri Devender Reddy, VO\nYoung Scientist Award – 2016 - Shri K Somashekar, Sc C\nSilicon Trophy – 2017 (DRDO Awards 2017)"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/lab-awards/centre-artificial-intelligence-robotics-cair", "content": "In recognition of its contribution by way of development of products of utility to the nations defence services, CAIR has received following prestigious Awards in the face of stiff competition:\nSilicon Trophy - 2005 - for being the best System Laboratory of DRDO\nTechnology Spin-off Award   - 2004\nAgni Award for self- reliance - 2003, 2005, 2006, 2008, 2010, 2011, 2013, 2014, 2017\nIn addition to the above, scientists/staff of CAIR have received following Awards in recognition of their contributions\nBest Techno Managerial Services / Popular Science Communication  2014\nPerformance Excellence Award 2008, 2009, 2013, 2014, 2016\nCERDEC Medal for Outstanding Technical Contribution 2010\nChief of Army Staffs Commendation 2009\nInstitute of Engineers Suman Sharma Award 2007\nBest Performance Award 2006, 2008, 2011\nYoung Scientist of the Year Award 2003, 2013, 2015, 2017\nScientist of the Year award 2003, 2006, 2007, 2009, 2010, 2011, 2013\nR&D Excellence Award from BEL FY 2004-2005\nMechanical Engineering Design Award 2003\nMarconi International Fellowships Young Scientist Award 1997\nINAE Young Engineer Award 1996\nDRDO Technology Award 1995, 1996"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/lab-awards/centre-fire-explosive-and-environment-safety-cfees", "content": "Govt. of India Medals\nGovt. of India Medals\nDetail\nQty.\nPresident’s Police & Fire Service Medal for Gallantry\n01\nPresident’s Fire Service Medal for Distinguished Service\n05\nFire Service Medal for Meritorious Service\n18\nDRDO Awards\nDRDO Awards\nDetail\nQty.\nAgni Award for Excellence in Self Reliance - 2009\n01\nDRDO Scientist of the Year Award - 2008 & 2010\n02\nBest Performance Award - 2005, 2014 & 2016\n03\nDRDO Award for Performance Excellence - 2016\n01\nDefence Technology Spin-off Award - 2006\n01\nDRDO Special Award for Strategic Contribution - 2008\n01\nYoung Scientist Award - 2012 & 2014\n02\nTitanium Trophy - 2012\n01\nBest Invention/Futuristic Development - 2014\n01\nGroup Technology Award - 2016\n01\nExternal Awards / Appreciation\nDr. S. S. Misra Memorial Award 2009 for the paper entitled “Development of anti-infective drug incorporated PVA-PEG semi-IPN based dressing for treatment of acute and chronic wounds” by National Academy of Medical Sciences.\nBest paper award for paper on “Post consumer PET waste as potential feed stock for coordination polymers” by IIT Delhi, December 2012.\nFirst prize in poster presentation competition “Sustainable bis-benzoxazines deived from cardanol and recycled poly (etyhylenetephthalate) by BACS University of Delhi.\nThird prize in oral presentation “ Magnetic silica nanoparticles for the removal of Pb+2 from water” by KSR College of Technology Tiruchengode, Tamilnadu."},
