, TO-D\n2018\nSri N Harikrishna Kumar,TO-B\n2017\nSri K Babu Rao, TO C\n2015\nMs T Padmavathi, PS A\n2012\nSri GVS Bhanu Prasad, AO\n2009\nPath Breaking\nSri J ShankerRao,OS& Team\n2015\nSA to RM Award\nSri G Gopal,Sc-D\n2014\nPerformance Excellance\nSri SS Sundaram,Sc-G & Team\n2005\nSri HD Kulkarni,Sc-G\n2003\nDRDO Award Performance for Excellance\nSri SS Sundaram,Sc-G & Team\n2005\nSri G Boopathy, Director DLRL & Team\n2009\nSri HD Kulkarni,Sc-G & Team\n2003\nCommendation by Chief of Naval Staff\nSri N Ratna Sekhar, Sc-F\n2016\nSmt. Preeti Gupta, Sc-E\n2016\nCommendation by Secretary, Dept. of Defence R&D and DG DRDO\nSri V Ram Chandra Prasad, Sc-D\n2017\nATVP Commendation\nSri CHLB Srinivas Sarma, TO-C\n2017\nIETE-IRSI(83) Award\nSri N Divakar, Sc-F\n1999\nOther Lab Awards\nLaboratory Awards\nOther Awards\nName & Designation\nYear\nNational Award for the Welfare of the Handicapped\nSri Chand Pasha, Technician-A\n2000\nSri PK Visweswara Rao Sr Stores Asst.\n1996"},
