{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/lab-awards/defence-materials-and-stores-research-and-development-establishment-dmsrde", "content": "National Awards\nThere were several glorious moments when the scientists of DMSRDE were recognized by national profession body for their outstanding contribution for science and technologies in the advance areas.Some of them are given below:\nG D Birla Gold Medal -2018\nby IIM, Kolkata\nBharat Ratna Mother Teresa Award Gold Medal -2018\nby Global Economics Progress and Research Association (GEPRRA), New Delhi\nNational Aeronautical Prize-2017\nBest Technical Paper Award -2018 of INMRA, Mumbai\nBest Presentation Award in  4th IEEE International Conference, IISc Bangalore\nDr. Shanti NathGhosh Memorial Award – 2018, MNNIT Allahabad\nTERI-IWA-United Nations Development Programme (UNDP) Water Sustainability Award 2022-23\nDRDO Awards\nTitanium Trophy\nDMSRDE Kanpur has been awarded the prestigious Titanium Trophy - 2016 given to the best S&T Laboratory. DMSRDE won this trophy second time for its remarkable research achievements in the fields of Personal Protection Systems, Technical Textiles, Stealth Materials, Aerospace Functional Materials, Rubber Seals, Fuels, Lubricants, Coolants and Nanomaterials for the Indian Armed Forces.\nAgni Award\nDMSRDE Kanpur has been awarded the prestigious Agni Award for Excellence in Self Reliance – 2018 for its outstanding technological contributions in the achievement of ab initio design, development, successful qualification and ToT to Indian industries of Bullet Proof Jackets (BPJs) for Indian Army GSQR 1438.\nSwachhata Pakhwada Award\nCertificate of commendation presented to Director DMSRDE in recognition of exemplary performance for the celebration of Swachhata Pakhwada during 1st to 15th Dec. 2021.\nDRTC Best Performance Award\n– 2017, 2018, 2020\nPatents Awarded\n- 92 Nos.\nTOTs Awarded\n- 96 Nos"},
