gn, Hydrodynamic Design Review for Propulsion Aerodynamics and System Engineering\nAwards - 2002\nAwards - 2002\nSr. No.\nName of the Awardee\nAward Name\nArea of Work\n1\nP Venugopalan, SC 'G'\nNational Aeronautical Prize\nEvolving and Establishing Joint Venture R&d and Production Between India and Russia and Leading Sucessful Flight Testing of Ramjet Based Supersonic Cruising Missile System In India\n2\nP Venugopalan, SC 'G'\nDRDO Scientist of The Year\nAwards - 2003\nAwards - 2003\nSr. No.\nName of the Awardee\nAward Name\nArea of Work\n1\nR.Balasubramanian, SC ‘C’\nDRDO Young Scientist Award\nDefence research & development laboratry, hyderabad has achieved a major technological accomplishment by bringing out an international standard reynolds averaged navier stokes solverusing chapman-enskog based upwind scheme and bladwinlomax splarat alamaras turbulent kodel to slove viscous flows past supersonic/hypersonic vehicles and ramjiet/scramjet propulsion systems.\n2\nM. Jayaramulu\nProduction Technology Award\nThe Aeronautical Society of India,new Delhi.\n3\nI. K Kaul\nSilver Trophy (Deptt. of Science & Technology)\nDepartment of Science and Technology has Honored Shri I K Kaul, SC ‘g’ Director Engineering By Presenting A Silver Trophy, In Recognition of his Services Rendered to Programme Advisory Commiteeon Robotic and Manufactuing From Year 2001 to 2004.\n4\nPrahlada\nDistinguished Aluminus Award (IISc, Bangalore)\nDepartment of aerospace engineering, indian institute of science, bangalore. The award presented on 20th december during the diamond jubilee celebration\nReliability and Quality Engineering in Aerospace Technologies (Request 2003)\nReliability and Quality Engineering in Aerospace Technologies (Request 2003)\nSr. No.\nName of the Awardee\nAward Name\nArea of Work\n1\nShri K Nagaraj, Ex Chief Executive, Cemilac\nLife Time Achievement Award\n2\nDr. K Sudhakara Rao Dy. Director (Retd.) Systems Reliability, VSSC\nSignificant contribution in the field of quality\n3\nShri K Seenaiah Group Director, QRG, Shar\nSignificant Contribution in the Field of Quality\n4\nShri CS Maheshwari, Director, R&QA, DRDL Dr. KM Reddy, SC ‘F’, DRDL Shri P Bhattacharjee,\nSC ‘F’, DRDL Shri K Sreenivasan,\nSC ‘E’, DRDL Shri CVS Sai Prasad,\nSC ‘E’, DRDL Shri V Anjaneya Prasad,\nSC ‘C’, DRDL\nTeam Award\n5\nShri N Ramalingiah, SC ‘D’\nADA, Bangalore\nAwards - 2004 PM Shram Award\nAwards - 2004 PM Shram Award\nSr. No.\nName of the Awardee\nAward Name\nArea of Work\n1\nMrs V Bhuvaneswari, STA\nPM Shram Devi\nIntegration of telemetry systems, stage level checks of telemetry sub systems and data analysis of checkout results which has resulted in failure free operation of systems, with special reference to the successful flight trials of “BRAHMOS” for PJ10\n2\nShri Prahlada, Director\nDRDO Scientist of the Year\n3\nP Venugopalan, SC 'G'\nDRDO Performance Excellence\n4\nPotnuru Satya Prasad, SC‘C’\nDRDO Young Scientist\n5\nLhs Rao,SC ‘G’ S Sundarrajan, SC ‘G’ Sibnathsom, SC ‘G’ BR Pandarinath,SC ‘F’ P Varadharaj, SC ‘F’ V Prameela, SC ‘E’ S Venugopal, SC ‘E’ V S N Murthy, SC ‘E’ Manoj Kumar, SC ‘D’ PVRR Bhogendra Rao, SC ‘D’\nDRDO Excellence Performance Team\n6\nS S Misra, SC ‘G’\nDRDO Path Breaking Research\nAwards - 2005\nAwards - 2005\nSr. No.\nName of the Awardee\nAward Name\nArea of Work\n1\nAK Chakrabarti, SC ‘H’\nNational Aeronautical Prize by AeSI\n2\nP.Varadaraj, SC ‘F’\nRocket & Related Technologies (Rocketry) by AeSI\n3\nAK Chakrabarti, SC ‘H’\nDRDO Scientist of the Year\n4\nSai Kumar, SC ‘E’\nAnweshak Award by Society of Aerospace Manufacturing Engineers\nAwards - 2006\nAwards - 2006\nSr. No.\nName of the Awardee\nAward Name\nArea of Work\n1\nD Rajendra Prasad, TECH ‘C’\nProduction Technology Award by AeSI\nSriman Narayana, TA ‘A’\n2\nR.N.Bhattacherjee, SC ‘G’\nDRDO Scientist of the Year\n3\nB.Narasimha Reddy, Jt. DIR\nDRDO Best Performance Award\n4\nN Prabhakar, Proj Dir (AD)\nDRDO Path Breaking Research / Outstanding Technology Development\nPSR Anjaneyulu\nN Isaac\nK Srinivas\nS Ramya\nNV Kadam, Consultant\nAwards - 2007\nAwards - 2007\nSr. No.\nName of the Awardee\nAward Name\nArea of Work\n1\nAjit B.Choudhary, Sc 'D'\nDRDO Young Scientist of the Year\n2\nG.Chandramouli, Sc 'G'\nBharat Ratna Sir M Visvesvarayya Award by Institute of Engineers\n3\nSmt.Indumathi SN, Sc 'C'\nYuva Anweshak Award by Society of Aerospace Manufacturing Engineers"},
