sh Award\n2018\nMithilesh Kumar, STA-B\nNSTL Cash Award\n2018\nRani Voruganti, AMS-III\nNSTL Cash Award\n2018\nJayalakshmi P, AMS-III\nNSTL Cash Award\n2018\nSiva Kumar BSS, TO-B\nNSTL Cash Award\n2018\nJayaram Majhi, TO-A\nNSTL Cash Award\n2018\nRambabu K, TO-A\nNSTL Cash Award\n2018\nChittaranjan Putty, STA-B\nNSTL Cash Award\n2018\nSrinivasa Rao D, STA-B\nNSTL Cash Award\n2018\nRamakrishna Ch, TO-A\nNSTL Cash Award\n2018\nParvathi Thakur, AMS-III\nNSTL Cash Award\n2018\nSrinivas PM, TO-A\nNSTL Cash Award\n2018\nBhujanga Rao Ch, Scientist-F\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nSivakumar K, Scientist-E\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nNageswara Rao Mamidi, Scientist-D\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nKiran Kumar RV, Scientist-D\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nGirish Kumar, STA-B\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nSrinivasa Rao D, TO-C\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nNarasimha Murty NV, TECH ASST-B\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nPrasada Rao SBV, TO-C\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nChoudary TP, Scientist-F\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nARVIND KUMAR GAHANOLIA, TECH-A\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nNVS Kasi V Rao Gamini, Scientist-E\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nK ANJAPPA, Scientist-B\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nT V Satya Rao, CHARGEMAN-I (M)\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nDabbiru Sreedhar Patnaik, Scientist-D\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nA Vamsidhar, TO-A\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nA V RAMANA, STA-B\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nJitendra Ahirwar, STA-B\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nDeepak Chandra Tiwari, STA-B\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nTavitiraju Ch, TO-A\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nSuvarna Raju T, TO\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nKedarnath C, Scientist-F\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nAbraham Varughese, Scientist-G\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nSuvarna Raju E, TO-B\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nJagannadham A, TO-B\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nVenkata Srinivas Kadagala, Scientist-C\nTechnology Group Award\n2018\nVenkata Rao Basam, Scientist-D\nTechnology Gro