{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/lab-awards/research-centre-imarat-rci", "content": "Awards/Honours/Recognitions\nFor their significant national contributions and unstinted efforts, RCI community has received many important honours, recognitions and awards. DRDO, engineering bodies, Aeronautical Society of India, Astronautical Society of India, other Ministries and many other scientific societies/institutes/organisations have conferred large number of recognitions and awards upon RCI fraternity. Few of the prominent awardees who have been associated with RCI includes :\nNational and International Recognitions\nDr APJ Abdul Kalam Bharat Ratna (1997)\nDr VK Saraswat Padma Bhushan (2013)\nShri JC Bhattacharya Padma Shri (1990)\nDr Avinash Chander Padma Shri (2013)\nDr G Satheesh Reddy AIAA Missile Systems Award, USA (2019)\nDr G Satheesh Reddy Silver Medal, Royal Aeronautical Society, London (2015)\nAwards for RCI\nIndependence Day NRDC Award 1992\nSilicon Trophy Award 2010\nBest Laboratory Award 2013\nPSU Summit e-Gov Award 2014\nCSI-Nihilent e-Governance Award 2015\nSAP ACE Award 2015"},
