{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/lab-awards/scientific-analysis-group-sag", "content": "DRDO Level\nMeghnath Saha Award (twice) of Ministry of Defence, DRDO, to Shri DK Garg, Ex-Director SAG.\nDRDO Award to Dr RK Khanna, Shri VK Mittal, Shri BM Suri, Dr (Ms) Neelam Bhalla, and Mrs Amita Malik.\nDRDO Award (Ist prize) to (Late) Sh DK Garg and Dr PK Saxena for their book \"Gupt Lekhan-Ek Parichay\" written in Hindi.\nName\nAward\nYear\nDr. S S Bedi Sc 'G'\nScientist of the Year Award\n2007\nMs. Noopur Shrotriya, Sc D\nYoung Scientist of the Year Award\n2008\nMs. Kuljeet Kaur,TOD\nBest Performance Award\n2008\nShri N Rajesh Pillai Sc 'F'\nScientist of the Year Award\n2009\nShri Girish Mishra, Sc 'C'\nYoung Scientist of the Year Award\n2010\nShri Yogesh Kumar Lather, Sc 'B'\nYoung Scientist of the Year Award\n2011\nShri SK Jilowa, TO 'A'\nBest Performance Award\n2011\nDr.Saibal K Pal, Sc 'F'\nScientist of the Year Award\n2012\nShri Dhruv Kant Singh, TO 'B'\nBest Performance Award\n2013\nShri Rajeev Thaman, Sc 'F' & Team\nShri Rajeev Thaman, Sc 'F'\nShri Abhijeet K Singh, Sc 'D'\nShri Vinay Verma, Sc 'C'\nShri Ashish Sonkar, Sc 'C'\nShri Mainak Garai, Sc 'C'\nMs. Bhawana Shakeet, Sc 'C'\nShri Aditya Raj, TO 'A'\nSpecial Award for Strategic Contribution\n2013\nShri SartajUlHasan , Sc 'D'\nYoung Scientist of the Year Award\n2014\nShri Sanchit K Gupta, Sc 'D'\nYoung Scientist of the Year Award\n2016\nShri Aditya Raj, TO 'A'\nBest Performance Award\n2016\nMs. Navneet Gaba, Sc ‘F’\nScientist of the year Award\n2016"},
