{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/lab-charter/electronics-radar-development-establishment-lrde", "content": "Design and Develop state-of-the-art Radar systems & Technologies meeting the Nation's Defence/ Security needs; establish self-reliance and export potential in the field of radars.\nIntegrate, test, evaluate, operationalise and provide life cycle support for radars on Ground, Surface / Sub-surface, Air & Space borne platforms including integration with weapon systems.\nPlan and Deploy Radar systems for Strategic Mission requirements."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/lab-charter/gas-turbine-research-establishment-gtre", "content": "1. Design & Development of Gas Turbine Engines for Aircrafts, UAVs, Cruise Vehicles and other Military Applications\n2. Research & Development of Constituent Technologies for Gas Turbine Engines and their Variants\n3. Establishment of State-of-the-art Gas Turbine Engine Test Facilities.\n4. To create Necessary Infrastructure & Test Facilities for R&D and LSP, as applicable.\n5. To generate all the necessary documentation.\n6. To support upgrades throughout product Life Cycle.\n7. To utilise technologies developed by other labs.\n8. To develop the Spin-Off technologies.\n9. To provide support and work with Govt. Agencies, Academia and Industry.\n10. To undertake Life Assessment and Extension activities, wherever required"},
