{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/technologies/defence-institute-high-altitude-research-dihar", "content": "Standard practices for growing of vegetables (temperate, tropical and subtropical) and fruits in high altitude\nExtending planting season of fruit crops in Ladakh\nStandard practices for greenhouse cultivation in Ladakh sector\nStandard practices for growing high altitude medicinal plants\nEarly season nursery raising\nEnergy efficient germplasm storage\nZero-energy potato storage for extended period (winter)\nMicrofarming in forward posts\nProcess for Seabuckthorn-based product development\nRearing practices of cattle and poultry in Ladakh\nEnhancing hatching percentage (60%) in high altitude"},
