{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/technologies/defence-institute-psychological-research-dipr", "content": "Technologies and Products\nComputerized Pilot Selection System (CPSS)\nTest for Selection of Sharp Shooters\nSituation Judgment Test: Working Manual\nPsychological Profiling of Entrant DRDO Scientists\nBehavioral Training Module (BTM)\nOther Rank Trade Allocation Battery (ORTAS)\nSelection System for Officers and Naviks of Indian Coast Guard\nScreening test for Territorial Army\nTest for screening of MARCOS\nSelection Battery for Personnel Below Officers Rank\nComprehensive Battery of Cognitive Abilities (CBCA)\nCognitive Battery for Officer Selection (CBOS)\nArmy Medical Corps Trade Allocation Battery (AMC-TAB)\nManual on Psychological Strength of Indian Soldier\nA Field Guide on Assessment & Management of Combat-stress Behaviors in Soldiers\nDevelopment of a psychological test for induction of Airmen in Indian Air Force\nPsychological Battery for Screening of Troops for their Induction as Commandos in the National Security Guard (NSG)\nPsychological Screening Test for ITBP Personnel\nComputerized Cognitive Battery for Officer Selection in Indian Coast Guard:\nVerbal & Non-Verbal Intelligence Tests for the selection officers at armed forces\nTest battery to identify potential officer candidates among recruits undergoing training\nComBAT App\nComputerised Battery of Spatial Cognition for Special Forces (CBSC)\nField Manuals\nSuicide and Fratricide: Dynamics and Management\nCombat Stress Behaviours in LIC Environment\nSelf Help Techniques in Military Settings\nManaging Crowd and Mass Panic: Psychosocial Guidelines\nCamouflage: A Soldier’s Manual\nPsychological Well-Being of Soldiers at High Altitude\nPsychological Strength of Indian Soldier\nAssessment and Management of Combat Stress Behaviours in Soldier\nBehavioural Training Modules\nSuicidal Behaviour: Prevention and Management"},
