{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/technologies/defence-materials-and-stores-research-and-development-establishment-dmsrde", "content": "Although the technologies have been developed keeping inview the needs of Services by putting in extensive R&D efforts, many of them are equally useful for civil sector. Some of these technologies are:-\nAdditive Run Diesel\nRust Converter\nLife Jacket\nMoisture Resistant Corrugated Fibre Board Box\nGlycol Based Anti freeze Coolant\nEngine Starting Aid Capsules\nCorrosion Inhibitor Concentrate Packs\nAuto Rust & Scale Inhibitor(ARS-70)\nSplint Inflatable\nSurvival Blanket\nJacket Wind cheater\nAnti-Riot Helmet\nTrouser Wind cheater\nAnti-RiotShield\nFootwear for Leprosy Patients\nPolymer Heart Valve\nAlcogel\nGloves Glacier"},
