{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/technologies/drdo-young-scientist-laboratory-dysl-qt", "content": "Prototypes\nQuantum Random Number Generator (QRNG) prototype was developed and randomness tested with NIST and Die-Harder and DRDO’s test-suites. The Single-box Portable QRNG prototype was demonstrated at AEROINDIA-2021. A QRNG device is supplied to a sister DRDO Lab for experimentation and further use.\nTechnologies\nQuantum Computing\nQuantum Algorithms\nQuantum Random Number Generators\nQuantum Communication\nQuantum Sensing"},
