{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/labs-establishment/technologies/research-development-establishment-rdee", "content": "Services\nTechnology\nCapabilities of R&DE(E)\nStructural Engineering\nDesign and Analysis of large structures and mechanics\nKinematics\nSynthesis analysis and design of drives and mechanisms\nHydraulics and Pneumatics\nDesign of high pressure hydraulic actuators, circuits and high pressure compressors\nAuxillary Power sources\n(Engineering, Silencing and Perform\nElectrical, mobile power sources, high frequently tools, non conventional power sources, auxiliary power units\nThermal and Environmental\nEngineering\nThermal conditioning and mobile coding system, pressure vessel technology, environmental and climatic test facility.\nManufacturing Technology\nApplication of light weight structural material, RDE-40 Al Alloy, Polymer Matrix Composites for combat engineering equipment and missile launcher high precision, large ferrous and non -ferrous structures, metrological and testing facilities.\nNBC Survival System\nDesign and development of shelters and mobile platforms for survival in NBC environment\nComputer Aided Engineering\nDesign simulation, visualization, engineering analysis and validation\nHydraulic Servo Drives\nControls and mechanism\nRobotics\nPlatform, manipulators, sensor integration, communications\nWeapon Launch system\nPlatform independent technology\nComposite material\nLarge structures in laminated composite material\nMEMS\nDesign of MEMS, MOEMS for various applications."},
