{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/mahila-kalyan-manch/objectives", "content": "To build a good network of all DRDO Mahila Kalyan Manch (MKM) members through internet and other means of communication.\nTo pursue programmes to facilitate development of academic/vocational skills.\nTo create multi-dimensional self-development of members of the Manch.\nTo provide succour to people affected by natural disasters."},
