{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/message-board/new-version-drdo-industry-partner-registration-20-will-be-launched-soon-till-time#top", "content": "A New version of DRDO Industry Partner Registration 2.0 will be launched soon. Till that time the existing DRDO Industry partner Registration Process is suspended.\n23/01/2025\nA New version of DRDO Industry Partner Registration 2.0 will be launched soon. Till that time the existing DRDO Industry partner Registration Process is suspended.\nडीआरडीओ उद्योग भागीदार पंजीकरण 2.0 का एक नया संस्करण जल्द ही लॉन्च किया जाएगा। उस समय तक मौजूदा डीआरडीओ उद्योग भागीदार पंजीकरण प्रक्रिया निलंबित है।"},
