{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/microwave-millimeter-wave-components-systems#top", "content": "Back to Listing\nMicrowave & Millimeter Wave Components & Systems\nLabs\nDefence Electronics Application Laboratory (DEAL)\nDev of MM Wave Components at 140 GHz freq Band Test And Measurement Facility\nReflectometer Test Bench Setup established using following Subsystem/ Components:\nD-Band Power Meter with Thermistor Mounts & Frequency Sensors\nD-Band Spectrum Analyser\nWave Meters\nDetectors\nIsolator/ Circulators\nSliding Matched Load\nVariable Attenuators\nFixed Pads 3, 6 & 10 dB\nDirectional Couplers 3, 6 10 & 20 dB\nStraight Sections 1”, 2” & 3”\nImage Acquired using 140 GHz Passive Imaging Sensor\nAll weather day and night imaging sensor with 13 mrad spatial and 1 K thermal resolution.\nImage data acquisition through raster scanning of sensor\nSee through Capability for concealed weapon Detection\nCamouflaged target detection\nMM Wave Combat identification of Friend or Foe System\nImages\nMillimeter Wave Components at  140 GHz\nMM Wave Combat identification of Friend or Foe System"},
