ytics Framework\nDr. Sahely Bhadra, Assistant Professor\nIIT, Palakkad\n484\nDevelopment Of Physical Layer Technologies And Prototypes For Acoustic Modem And Performance Evaluation By Channel Characterization & Modelling\nNithin james, Assistant professor\nMar Athanasius College of Engineering\n485\nUnderstanding the influence of corrotion on the shock response of DMR -249A steel plates and welded joints\nDr S Suresh kumar, Associate Professor\nSSN College of Engineering\n488\nAssessment of additive manufactured titanium alloy & cast nickel aluminium bronje alloy an explanatory study for naval propellen material\nDr. Manl Kumar Mishra\nMNIT, Jaipur"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/naval-research-board/specialist-panels-constitution", "content": "Material (MAT) Panel\nPanel Chairman : Dr. N Prabhu, Professor\nDepartment of Metallurgical Engineering & Materials Science,\nIIT - Bombay, Powai, Mumbai- 400076\nMob:\n9833107624\nE-mail :\n- nprabhu[at]iitb[dot]ac[dot]in\nDRDO\nMEMBERS\n1\nDr. Sandeep Sangal\nProfessor,Department of Materials Science and Engineering, Indian Institute of Technology, Kanpur 208016\nTele :\n+91 - (0)512 - 2597167 / 2597975\nFax :\n91-512-2590007 / 2597505\nE-mail :\nsangals[at]iitk[dot]ac[dot]in\n2\nDr. Shiv Brat Singh\nProfessor, Department of Metallurgical and Materials Engineering,\nIndian Institute of Technology, Kharagpur - 721 302 West Bengal, INDIA\nTele :\n+91-3222-283290\nFax :\n91-3222-282280\nE-mail :\nsbs22[at]metal[dot]iitkgp[dot]ac[dot]in\n3\nDr. Kanupriya Sachdev\nProfessor, Department of Physics & Materials Research Centre &\nHead, Department of Physics, Malaviya National Institute of Technology, Jaipur- 302017\nTele :\n+91-141-2713250\nFax :\n+91-141-2529029\nE-mail :\nksachdev[dot]phy[at]mnit[dot]ac[dot]in\n4\nProf. Suryasarathi Bose\nDepartment of Materials Engineering,\nIndian Institute of Science, Bengalure-560012\nTele :\n+91-80-22933407\nE-mail :\nsbose[at]iisc[dot]ac[dot]in\n5\nShri Vinay P Deshmukh\nScientist 'G'\nHead (NMD), Naval Materials Research Lab (NMRL),\nShilBadalpur Road, MIDC Area, P.O. Anandnagar, Addl. Ambernath Distt. Thane, Maharashtra-421506\nTele :\n91-0251-2623009\nE-mail :\nvpd_nmrl1[at]rediffmail[dot]com\n6\nDr. Ramesh Kumar A.V.\nScientist 'F'\nNPOL, Kochi – 682021\nTelephone:\n0484-2571265\nMobile:\n9895709665\nFax:\n0484-2424858\nEmail:\navramesh[dot]npol[at]gov[dot]in\nEmail:\navramesh[dot]kumar[at]gmail[dot]com\n7\nDr. Jalaj Kumar,\nScientist 'F'\nDMRL, Hyderabad-500058\nMobile:\n9963114320\nTele :\n040-24586469\nE-mail :\njalaj[dot]dmrl[at]gov[dot]in\n8\nCmde (NA)\nDte of Naval Architechture (DNA), IHQ MoD (Navy), 200 Talkatora Sta