Engineering Indian Institute of Technology Kharagpur- 721 302.\nTele :\n03222-282934\nFax :\n03222-255303\nE-mail :\nkumar[at]mech[dot]iitkgp[dot]ernet[dot]in, cs[at]kumar[at]gmail[dot]com\n4\nCmde(ME)\nDirectorate of Marine Engineering (DME), Naval Headquarters, Sena Bhawan, New Delhi- 110011\nTele :\n011-23010733\nFax :\n011-23011352\nE-mail :\ndme-navy[at]nic[dot]in\n5\nShri Sunny Verma\nScientist 'D'\nNSTL, Visakhapatnam - 530027\nTelephone:\n0891-2586424\nMobile :\n9966679433\nHydrodynamics (HYDRO) Panel\nPanel Chairman :Dr. P Krishnankutty\nProfessor (Retd), Dept. of Ocean Engineering, IIT Madras\n(Currently) Emeritus Professor, Dept. of Ship Technology, CUSAT.\nE-mail : krishnankuttyp[at]gmail[dot]com;\npkrishnankutty[at]faculty.iitm[dot]ac[dot]in;\nMob : 9884707672\nDRDO\nMEMBERS\n1\nDr.Raghuram Govardhan,\nProfessor\nDept. of Mechanical Engg.,\nIISc Bangalore\nEmail: rng[at]iisc[dot]ac[dot]in\nMob: 9845182640\n2\nDr.Vishwanath Nagarajan,\nProfessor\nDept. of Ocean Engg. & Naval Arch.,\nIIT Kharagpur\nEmail: vishwanath_n[at]naval.iitkgp[dot]ac[dot]in\nMob: 8016727912\n3\nDr.R.Vijayakumar,\nProfessor\nDept. of Ocean Engg,\nIIT Madras\nEmail: vijay2028[at]iitm[dot]ac[dot]in\nMob: 8745028640\n4\nDr.Manasa Behera,\nProfessor\nDept. of Civil Engg,\nIIT Bombay\nEmail: manasa.rb[at]iitb[dot]ac[dot]in\nMob: 7506177313\n5\nDr.Sharad Dhavalikar,\nPrincipal Surveyor,\nIndian Register of Shipping, Mumbai\nEmail: ss.dhavalikar[at]irclass.org\nMob: 9821974760\n6\nMr.C.P.Kuriakose,\nScientist G\nNRB Coordinator,\nNPOL, Kochi\nEmail: kuriakosecp.npol[at]gov[dot]in\nMob: 9446339290\n7\nMr Roni Francis,\nScientist G\nNPOL, Kochi\nEmail: ronifrancis.npol[at]gov[dot]in\nMob: 9961449575\n8\nMr V. F. Saji,\nScientist F\nNRB Coordinator,\nNSTL, Vizag.\nE-mail :  saji.vf.nstl[at]gov[dot]in\nMob: 9397330672\n9\nMr.Arpan Sharma,\nScientist D\nNSTL, Vizag.\nE-mail :  arpansharma.nstl[at]gov[dot]in\nMob: 9397330672\n10\nCmde Manoj K Joseph,\nPrincipal Director\nWDB, DND,\nIndian Navy\n