{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/nuclear-shielding-pads-combat-vehicles#top", "content": "Back to Listing\nNuclear Shielding Pads for Combat  Vehicles\nLabs\nDefence Materials and Stores Research and Development Establishment (DMSRDE)\nTechnology Cluster\nNaval Systems and Materials (NS & M)\nNuclear Shielding Pads for Infantry combat vehicles (BMK-II and BMK-IIK) and Combat Vehicles (T72 and T90) for protection against nuclear radiation."},
