{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/paramilitary-variant-whap-8x8", "content": "Back to Listing\nParamilitary Variant of WhAP 8x8\nLabs\nVehicles Research and Development Establishment (VRDE)\nTechnology Cluster\nArmament & Combat Engineering Systems (ACE)\nParamilitary Forces have placed an order on VRDE (DRDO) to meet their requirements for ‘Paramilitary variant of WhAP, 8x8’ under ‘Deposit Works’ category. After incorporation of User suggested modifications all the Vehicles have been realized and handed over to Users."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/passive-countermeasures#top", "content": "Technology Category\nTechnology Development Task\nLab\nIR Flare\nIR flare for Airborne Counter Measure Dispensation System (CMDS)\nHEMRL\nMagnesium Teflon Viton (MTV) IR Flare for airborne platforms\nHEMRL\nPyrophoric based flares for heat seeking missiles\nHEMRL\nAI based Smart Chaff Technologies & VR based Training Modules for  Chaff Operational Tactics\nDLJ\nBand Specific Chaff along with Smart Chaff Deployment System\nDLJ\nChaff / Microwave Obscurant Clouds for Safe Corridor application\nDLJ\nChaff materials/ Payload up to Ka band along with Smart Chaff Deployment System\nDLJ\nChaff Technology for airborne platforms\nDLJ\nCreation of Chaff/ Microwave Obscurant Clouds Corridor to safeguard Army Assets\nDLJ\nDynamic Radar Cross Section (RCS) Signature Management of Combat Platforms\nDLJ\nJammer Integrated Chaff Technologies\nDLJ\nRadar Cross Section (RCS) Measurement of Chaff fired from Aircraft\nDLJ\nNaval Flare\nAnti sonar device for submarine\nHEMRL\nSignal (red and green) flares for submarine\nHEMRL\nSmoke Grenade\nSmoke grenade to obscure the enemy missiles in visual,  laser, thermal and mm Wave region\nHEMRL"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/pcm-col-vests-caps#top", "content": "Back to Listing\nPCM Col Vests & Caps\nLabs\nDefence Laboratory Jodhpur (DLJ)\nTechnology Cluster\nNaval Systems and Materials (NS & M)\nCool vests based on Phase change materials provide comfort to the service personnel on field duties, tank cabin crew etc. During high heat conditions of summer the product has been field evaluated and found to be effective for a duration of 2-3 hours."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/pdds-x#top", "content": "Back to Listing\nPDDS-X\nTechnology Cluster\nNaval Systems and Materials (NS & M)\nPortable Diver Detecon Sonar is a portable sonar system capable of detecting, tracking and classifying potential underwater threats like divers and diver delivery vehicles in shallow waters. The system can be deployed either outboard a ship or at any location in a harbor, typically beside a wall, pier or at the sea bottom.\nSalient Features\nCapable of detecting targets around 360° in azimuthal plane and up to 20° in elevation\nUseful for protection of waterside assets and installations with 24x7 surveillance\nDeployable wet-end unit electronics with associated launch and recovery mechanism\nProvides sonar picture in desired format and tactical picture with map overlay"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/peek-insulator-tube#top", "content": "Back to Listing\nPEEK Insulator Tube\nLabs\nDefence Materials and Stores Research and Development Establishment (DMSRDE)\nTechnology Cluster\nNaval Systems and Materials (NS & M)\nPEEK insulator tube for the fuel line of LCA Tejas. The tube protects the fuel line from thunder and lightning during flight by providing strong insulation on the surface, thus protecting it from any fire-related incident."},
