{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/quick-drying-specialty-primer#top", "content": "Back to Listing\nQuick Drying Specialty Primer\nLabs\nDefence Materials and Stores Research and Development Establishment (DMSRDE)\nTechnology Cluster\nNaval Systems and Materials (NS & M)\nThe quick drying specialty primer is based on acrylic polymer and chromate (ACB – Primer). It has properties at par with the Russian Primer AK – 070."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/radar-absorbing-structural-ras-composites#top", "content": "Back to Listing\nRadar Absorbing Structural (Ras) Composites\nLabs\nDefence Materials and Stores Research and Development Establishment (DMSRDE)\nTechnology Cluster\nNaval Systems and Materials (NS & M)\nCarbon Veils (CV) and Frequency Selective Surfaces (FSS) based radar Absorbing Structural (RAS) Composites provide stealth capabilities with simultaneously meeting structural and environmental requirements of airborne platforms."},
