{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/sh-vedveer-arya#top", "content": "Sh. Vedveer Arya\nIDAS:97, Additional Financial Adviser (R&D) & JS, Ministry of Defence (Finance)"},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/shear-stiffening-gel#top", "content": "Back to Listing\nShear Stiffening Gel\nLabs\nDefence Materials and Stores Research and Development Establishment (DMSRDE)\nTechnology Cluster\nNaval Systems and Materials (NS & M)\nShear Stiffening Gel shows the change in viscosity as a function of shear force and holds a great promise for damping and shock energy dissipation."},
{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/short-span-bridge-10m", "content": "Back to Listing\nShort Span Bridge 10m\nLabs\nResearch & Development Establishment (Engrs.)\nTechnology Cluster\nArmament & Combat Engineering Systems (ACE)\nIt is a mechanically launched short span bridging system of MLC-70 load class to bridge the smaller gaps and canals upto 10m length.\nSalient Features:\nHigh mobility launching platform suitable for heavy military traffic\nDouble ‘A’ shaped trestle provides stability\nQuick construction with minimum crew\nBeta light for deployment at night"},
