{"url": "https://www.drdo.gov.in/drdo/visual-camouflage-coatings-laser-absorbing-properties#top", "content": "Back to Listing\nVisual Camouflage Coatings With Laser Absorbing Properties\nLabs\nDefence Materials and Stores Research and Development Establishment (DMSRDE)\nTechnology Cluster\nNaval Systems and Materials (NS & M)\nCoatings in twelve different camouflage shades (as per IS-5 standard) prevent or delay the detection of objects by the sensors working in the Visual region and LASERs [ND:YAG (1.060 µm)  and ND:GLASS (1.540 µm]"},
